(525408, 52510, 12332, '<td valign="top">Sorry, but I don''t see how this meets the challenge.  This shot proves that you can pan, but includes too much foreground and sky to be interesting.  Try cropping in on the truck, and I think you''ll like it better.</td>', 'Sorry, but I don''t see how this meets the challenge.  This shot proves that you can pan, but includes too much foreground and sky to be interesting.  Try cropping in on the truck, and I think you''ll like it better.', '2003-12-29 12:35:24.000000', NULL, 1),
