(525414, 52540, 7106, '<td valign="top">I''m assuming his Christmas present came in this box, and he ended up playing w/ the box more then the toy.. kids, go figure ;). I really like the expression he is showing.</td>', 'I''m assuming his Christmas present came in this box, and he ended up playing w/ the box more then the toy.. kids, go figure ;). I really like the expression he is showing.', '2003-12-29 12:44:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(525415, 52501, 12332, '<td valign="top">While I understand the logic of the text, the "motivation" is unclear.  Is this supposed to promote promiscuity or discourage it?  As for the photo, the plants in the background detract from the subject, and the shadows on t</td>', 'While I understand the logic of the text, the "motivation" is unclear.  Is this supposed to promote promiscuity or discourage it?  As for the photo, the plants in the background detract from the subject, and the shadows on t', '2003-12-29 12:44:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(525417, 51971, 12332, '<td valign="top">Interesting photo.  I wish your motivational phrase was more clearly connected to it.  Did Eiffel have a dream which he chased?  Was he an idiot?  Or is this fellow in the photo looking at a rainbow and thinking about chasing it?  Are the rainbows you mention real ones (in which case chasing them is foolish!) or metaphorical (not foolish - but contradictory to something like the Eiffel Tower).</td>', 'Interesting photo.  I wish your motivational phrase was more clearly connected to it.  Did Eiffel have a dream which he chased?  Was he an idiot?  Or is this fellow in the photo looking at a rainbow and thinking about chasing it?  Are the rainbows you mention real ones (in which case chasing them is foolish!) or metaphorical (not foolish - but contradictory to something like the Eiffel Tower).', '2003-12-29 12:46:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(525418, 51876, 12332, '<td valign="top">I would like to see more of the truck and the context of its demise.  Too  much sky in this shot, I think.</td>', 'I would like to see more of the truck and the context of its demise.  Too  much sky in this shot, I think.', '2003-12-29 12:47:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(525419, 52022, 7106, '<td valign="top">Interesting idea. Good use of some of the functions on your camera that some people would never think to use.   Have they fired Jauron yet or not? ha  1p.m. today ;)</td>', 'Interesting idea. Good use of some of the functions on your camera that some people would never think to use.   Have they fired Jauron yet or not? ha  1p.m. today ;)', '2003-12-29 12:47:43.000000', NULL, 1),
