(525431, 52503, 12332, '<td valign="top">Interesting photo, but it lacks sharpness a little, and the diffuse lighting takes away from it.  Also, the phrase being about a cave and fear doesn''t clearly tie to a door - the fear is not evident, so the metaphorical cave entrance (the door) doesn''t work as well.</td>', 'Interesting photo, but it lacks sharpness a little, and the diffuse lighting takes away from it.  Also, the phrase being about a cave and fear doesn''t clearly tie to a door - the fear is not evident, so the metaphorical cave entrance (the door) doesn''t work as well.', '2003-12-29 13:00:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(525433, 52527, 12332, '<td valign="top">A pretty picture.  But which is hope, faith?  The tie between the the photo and the phrase is unclear.  Also, there''s a lot of dark green in the shot that could be cropped or lightened for better effect, I think.</td>', 'A pretty picture.  But which is hope, faith?  The tie between the the photo and the phrase is unclear.  Also, there''s a lot of dark green in the shot that could be cropped or lightened for better effect, I think.', '2003-12-29 13:01:17.000000', NULL, 1),
