(525478, 52378, 12049, '<td valign="top">Very nice composition and use of light. I do think, however, that the title and text is too dominant - so much so that it overpowers the photo when the two should be able to coexist.</td>', 'Very nice composition and use of light. I do think, however, that the title and text is too dominant - so much so that it overpowers the photo when the two should be able to coexist.', '2003-12-29 13:37:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(525480, 52544, 12049, '<td valign="top">Nice photo, but I don''t think that the title and text are quite succinct enough. The image needs to be more strongly related to your theme.</td>', 'Nice photo, but I don''t think that the title and text are quite succinct enough. The image needs to be more strongly related to your theme.', '2003-12-29 13:39:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(525482, 52549, 12049, '<td valign="top">Image is a bit fuzzy and the lighting flat, though the composition is good. This kind of poster needs a single word title to be most effective - your ''message'' isn''t clear enough.</td>', 'Image is a bit fuzzy and the lighting flat, though the composition is good. This kind of poster needs a single word title to be most effective - your ''message'' isn''t clear enough.', '2003-12-29 13:40:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(525484, 52550, 12049, '<td valign="top">Reasonable image, though you should have revisited your submission when the rules were changed to allow text.</td>', 'Reasonable image, though you should have revisited your submission when the rules were changed to allow text.', '2003-12-29 13:41:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(525485, 52475, 12049, '<td valign="top">Too much text, and the idea is copied directly from a similar image at www.depair.com. The photo could do with having more detail, and the upper part of the image is a bit messy. Nice strong colors though.</td>', 'Too much text, and the idea is copied directly from a similar image at www.depair.com. The photo could do with having more detail, and the upper part of the image is a bit messy. Nice strong colors though.', '2003-12-29 13:43:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(525487, 52375, 12049, '<td valign="top">A little too opaque to be motivational. The choice of font and style is interesting, but not ''serious'' enough for a motivational poster. As far as the image is concerned, it''s well compsosed, but it would be great if one of the figures was closer than the other to allow you to use DOF to your advantage and focus on one of the two players.</td>', 'A little too opaque to be motivational. The choice of font and style is interesting, but not ''serious'' enough for a motivational poster. As far as the image is concerned, it''s well compsosed, but it would be great if one of the figures was closer than the other to allow you to use DOF to your advantage and focus on one of the two players.', '2003-12-29 13:45:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(525488, 52536, 12049, '<td valign="top">Nice image. I''d have liked to have seen more of her face though. The overall concept is a little vague though, where a motivational poster needs to be instantly understandable.</td>', 'Nice image. I''d have liked to have seen more of her face though. The overall concept is a little vague though, where a motivational poster needs to be instantly understandable.', '2003-12-29 13:46:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(525489, 52334, 12049, '<td valign="top">Tha baby looks really freaked out! I''m sorry, it just distracts from everything else. It also looks like a cut and paste job of the portrait onto the background, resulting in a very artificial image. For a motivational poster, this has too much text.</td>', 'Tha baby looks really freaked out! I''m sorry, it just distracts from everything else. It also looks like a cut and paste job of the portrait onto the background, resulting in a very artificial image. For a motivational poster, this has too much text.', '2003-12-29 13:48:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(525490, 52490, 12049, '<td valign="top">Nice image and simple message. It''s a minor point, but there''s no clear idea of which is the lead goose here. Typically they will take turns to lead, and if you had been able to capture that it may well have been a more powerful image and concept.</td>', 'Nice image and simple message. It''s a minor point, but there''s no clear idea of which is the lead goose here. Typically they will take turns to lead, and if you had been able to capture that it may well have been a more powerful image and concept.', '2003-12-29 13:50:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(525492, 52541, 12049, '<td valign="top">Overall it''s well presented, but the image should be powerful enough to stand on it''s own, and I don''t think that this one is. You''re verging on too much text as well - the message should be more succinct.</td>', 'Overall it''s well presented, but the image should be powerful enough to stand on it''s own, and I don''t think that this one is. You''re verging on too much text as well - the message should be more succinct.', '2003-12-29 13:52:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(525494, 52310, 12049, '<td valign="top">Nice idea, though could have been more dramatic if you could have found a better-lit subject. Photographically, it seems to just be a metering error - unless you were going for this look. The titie is a little too small to work effectively.</td>', 'Nice idea, though could have been more dramatic if you could have found a better-lit subject. Photographically, it seems to just be a metering error - unless you were going for this look. The titie is a little too small to work effectively.', '2003-12-29 13:53:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(525496, 52478, 12049, '<td valign="top">Nice image but a vague concept. The idea of promotion only works if you create a comparative theme, so with a single subject it isn''t strong enough. Did you consider cropping closer to get rid of the untidy feathers?</td>', 'Nice image but a vague concept. The idea of promotion only works if you create a comparative theme, so with a single subject it isn''t strong enough. Did you consider cropping closer to get rid of the untidy feathers?', '2003-12-29 13:55:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(525500, 52539, 12049, '<td valign="top">For me, too much text, with a title that''s too small. Nice composition, though I''d like to have seen more light on the lighthouse and a straighter horizon. Given the flexibility of the December rule set, I''d also have changed the color of the green beacon as it distracts a little.</td>', 'For me, too much text, with a title that''s too small. Nice composition, though I''d like to have seen more light on the lighthouse and a straighter horizon. Given the flexibility of the December rule set, I''d also have changed the color of the green beacon as it distracts a little.', '2003-12-29 13:57:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(525504, 52468, 12049, '<td valign="top">It isn''t really clear what this image is. In a motivational poster, the image needs to stand on it''s own. It''s also a pity you didn''t have an opportunity to add text to this when the rules were amended.</td>', 'It isn''t really clear what this image is. In a motivational poster, the image needs to stand on it''s own. It''s also a pity you didn''t have an opportunity to add text to this when the rules were amended.', '2003-12-29 13:58:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(525506, 52366, 12049, '<td valign="top">This isn''t exposed very well, though you chose a great subject. A closer crop to remove all the distracting woodwork may have worked even better.</td>', 'This isn''t exposed very well, though you chose a great subject. A closer crop to remove all the distracting woodwork may have worked even better.', '2003-12-29 13:59:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(525511, 52532, 12049, '<td valign="top">Very good idea, though I''d like to have been able to see more of the canoeist. Not an easy subject to capture though. The white text is a bit small.</td>', 'Very good idea, though I''d like to have been able to see more of the canoeist. Not an easy subject to capture though. The white text is a bit small.', '2003-12-29 14:01:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(525512, 52552, 327, '<td valign="top">I think your ideaand  slogan was good. The light needed to be raised a bit to see the top of the coins. All your focus is on the dollar bills and the coins are a bit soft. Over all I like this shot.</td>', 'I think your ideaand  slogan was good. The light needed to be raised a bit to see the top of the coins. All your focus is on the dollar bills and the coins are a bit soft. Over all I like this shot.', '2003-12-29 14:02:19.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(525514, 52465, 2923, '<td valign="top">A bit underexposed, and increase saturation would help this image a lot.</td>', 'A bit underexposed, and increase saturation would help this image a lot.', '2003-12-29 14:02:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(525515, 52444, 327, '<td valign="top">Stunning impact. I like it. Compliments only.</td>', 'Stunning impact. I like it. Compliments only.', '2003-12-29 14:02:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(525516, 52541, 327, '<td valign="top">Beautifully done. Compliments only. Love it.</td>', 'Beautifully done. Compliments only. Love it.', '2003-12-29 14:03:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(525517, 52530, 12049, '<td valign="top">The photo is good, but the concept doesn''t work very well for me. I also hate to be a stickler, but there should be a period/full-stop after ''day''. The pink framing is a bit unsettling as well, and hurts this image.</td>', 'The photo is good, but the concept doesn''t work very well for me. I also hate to be a stickler, but there should be a period/full-stop after ''day''. The pink framing is a bit unsettling as well, and hurts this image.', '2003-12-29 14:03:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(525519, 52539, 327, '<td valign="top">Bravo. Compliments to you. Text is a bit small. Maybe it needs quotes and the author? Still a dandy shot.</td>', 'Bravo. Compliments to you. Text is a bit small. Maybe it needs quotes and the author? Still a dandy shot.', '2003-12-29 14:04:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(525520, 52136, 2923, '<td valign="top">Nice colors but the horizon isn''t level making it sort of conflicting for the viewer.</td>', 'Nice colors but the horizon isn''t level making it sort of conflicting for the viewer.', '2003-12-29 14:04:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(525521, 52460, 12049, '<td valign="top">Great timing and composition. The text could be a little clearer though.</td>', 'Great timing and composition. The text could be a little clearer though.', '2003-12-29 14:04:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(525524, 52375, 327, '<td valign="top">LOL wonderful. Only compliments. Fine shot, super color.</td>', 'LOL wonderful. Only compliments. Fine shot, super color.', '2003-12-29 14:05:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(525526, 52465, 327, '<td valign="top">:0) Very nice.</td>', ':0) Very nice.', '2003-12-29 14:05:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(525527, 52530, 11738, '<td valign="top">Nice image but the sky is just too pink.  I would have scored this higher had the sky\''s color not been played with as much.  An more orange cast would have suited this image better than pink.  You might have also edited out those two little clouds sitting above the gazebo.</td>', 'Nice image but the sky is just too pink.  I would have scored this higher had the sky\''s color not been played with as much.  An more orange cast would have suited this image better than pink.  You might have also edited out those two little clouds sitting above the gazebo.', '2003-12-29 14:06:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(525529, 52478, 327, '<td valign="top">Really nice. Might of moved the crop up a bit, but just a thought. Nice work. Compliments!</td>', 'Really nice. Might of moved the crop up a bit, but just a thought. Nice work. Compliments!', '2003-12-29 14:07:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(525530, 52361, 12049, '<td valign="top">I believe that you are using the lighthouse to communicate a notion of guidance, so why not take the shot at night when it''s working? It would also have worked better if composed as a poster, but tyou probably missed the rules update.</td>', 'I believe that you are using the lighthouse to communicate a notion of guidance, so why not take the shot at night when it''s working? It would also have worked better if composed as a poster, but tyou probably missed the rules update.', '2003-12-29 14:07:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(525531, 52536, 327, '<td valign="top">Whaaaaaaaa! Love her, love the pose. The hair! Awesome shot. Maybe a bit more focus on the face..? Just my opinion. Bravo.</td>', 'Whaaaaaaaa! Love her, love the pose. The hair! Awesome shot. Maybe a bit more focus on the face..? Just my opinion. Bravo.', '2003-12-29 14:08:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(525533, 52519, 12049, '<td valign="top">A good idea, but would have been better executed if you could have found stationary traffic beside light trails. Another more minor point is that you''re missing a space between ''Life'' and ''In''.</td>', 'A good idea, but would have been better executed if you could have found stationary traffic beside light trails. Another more minor point is that you''re missing a space between ''Life'' and ''In''.', '2003-12-29 14:09:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(525534, 52364, 2923, '<td valign="top">If the guy is closer to the camera, it''ll have a better impact, also, if you view him from a even lower angle (i.e. if he''s close you can do that), it''ll increase the impact more. 6</td>', 'If the guy is closer to the camera, it''ll have a better impact, also, if you view him from a even lower angle (i.e. if he''s close you can do that), it''ll increase the impact more. 6', '2003-12-29 14:09:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(525535, 52557, 11738, '<td valign="top">Awsome light.  Too bad the central inscription on the statue isn''t centered in the frame.  Personally I would have cropped higher so that we would have seen the stones under the soldiers feet without including the brown base with the gold lettering.  I think this who have helped center the image better.  Nice work!</td>', 'Awsome light.  Too bad the central inscription on the statue isn''t centered in the frame.  Personally I would have cropped higher so that we would have seen the stones under the soldiers feet without including the brown base with the gold lettering.  I think this who have helped center the image better.  Nice work!', '2003-12-29 14:09:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(525536, 51876, 327, '<td valign="top">Whoops. Looks like  Wyoming I-90. Hope they were okay. Luck you had your camera along with you. Good capture.</td>', 'Whoops. Looks like  Wyoming I-90. Hope they were okay. Luck you had your camera along with you. Good capture.', '2003-12-29 14:09:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(525537, 52507, 12049, '<td valign="top">A little to facile, though it does work. A motivational poster should not be too abstract, but should challenge you nonetheless.</td>', 'A little to facile, though it does work. A motivational poster should not be too abstract, but should challenge you nonetheless.', '2003-12-29 14:10:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(525539, 52540, 327, '<td valign="top">Clever idea. Focus is a wee bit too soft but I do like this.</td>', 'Clever idea. Focus is a wee bit too soft but I do like this.', '2003-12-29 14:10:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(525540, 52477, 12049, '<td valign="top">This just isn''t clear enough to me, and certainly isn''t motivational. The image works well, but not in this context.</td>', 'This just isn''t clear enough to me, and certainly isn''t motivational. The image works well, but not in this context.', '2003-12-29 14:11:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(525541, 52530, 2923, '<td valign="top">I think the colors are way overly saturated (they''re clipping), otherwise a nice shot.</td>', 'I think the colors are way overly saturated (they''re clipping), otherwise a nice shot.', '2003-12-29 14:11:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(525542, 51848, 327, '<td valign="top">Wonderful focus, light and presentation. Compliments only.</td>', 'Wonderful focus, light and presentation. Compliments only.', '2003-12-29 14:11:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(525543, 51848, 11738, '<td valign="top">Nice image.  Not too crazy about the font used for "BE STRONG" and "STRENGTH".  I really like the way you superimposed the different kinds of text.</td>', 'Nice image.  Not too crazy about the font used for "BE STRONG" and "STRENGTH".  I really like the way you superimposed the different kinds of text.', '2003-12-29 14:11:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(525544, 52271, 12049, '<td valign="top">Too abstract for me. The cutoff between lit and dark areas is a little severe, so much so that you seem to have some blown out highlights.</td>', 'Too abstract for me. The cutoff between lit and dark areas is a little severe, so much so that you seem to have some blown out highlights.', '2003-12-29 14:12:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(525545, 52459, 327, '<td valign="top">Nicely done. Great colors and composition. Focus could of been a bit better or the bottom cropped tighter. Just my opinion.</td>', 'Nicely done. Great colors and composition. Focus could of been a bit better or the bottom cropped tighter. Just my opinion.', '2003-12-29 14:12:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(525546, 52512, 11738, '<td valign="top">I would have preferred seeing the corporate look of a strong black border with text outside the image rather than having the text inside the image.  However, your choice of site for the text is appropriate.  Very nice shot.  Among my favourites.</td>', 'I would have preferred seeing the corporate look of a strong black border with text outside the image rather than having the text inside the image.  However, your choice of site for the text is appropriate.  Very nice shot.  Among my favourites.', '2003-12-29 14:13:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(525547, 52534, 12049, '<td valign="top">I think that the image is too stark and in some ways agressive. In a motivational sense, I''m not sure that your concept works.</td>', 'I think that the image is too stark and in some ways agressive. In a motivational sense, I''m not sure that your concept works.', '2003-12-29 14:13:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(525548, 52472, 327, '<td valign="top">Nicely done. I like all the white and the text. Not sure why the banner is raised..but it''s okay. I think the green could of had a saturation boost. ?just my opinion.</td>', 'Nicely done. I like all the white and the text. Not sure why the banner is raised..but it''s okay. I think the green could of had a saturation boost. ?just my opinion.', '2003-12-29 14:13:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(525549, 52479, 327, '<td valign="top">The text should of been centered and the authors name a bit smaller? Just my opinion. The shot is great in these tones, and of course the moon is fantastic.</td>', 'The text should of been centered and the authors name a bit smaller? Just my opinion. The shot is great in these tones, and of course the moon is fantastic.', '2003-12-29 14:14:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(525550, 51995, 12049, '<td valign="top">Nice image, though I don''t quite get the arrows. It really needs to have the title as the dominant piece of text, as it is it just doesn''t have immediate impact.</td>', 'Nice image, though I don''t quite get the arrows. It really needs to have the title as the dominant piece of text, as it is it just doesn''t have immediate impact.', '2003-12-29 14:14:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(525552, 52530, 5508, '<td valign="top">I don''t like the pink lines. But a beautiful shot none the less. 10</td>', 'I don''t like the pink lines. But a beautiful shot none the less. 10', '2003-12-29 14:15:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(525554, 52467, 327, '<td valign="top">Nice, nice. Compliments only.</td>', 'Nice, nice. Compliments only.', '2003-12-29 14:16:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(525558, 52503, 12049, '<td valign="top">To abstract. It may sound like a facile comment, but the image is just too far away from the notion of a cave, and though well composed doesn''t stand on it''s own here. You should consider a curves adjustment because the exposure is off as well - underexposed bush and overexposed door frame.</td>', 'To abstract. It may sound like a facile comment, but the image is just too far away from the notion of a cave, and though well composed doesn''t stand on it''s own here. You should consider a curves adjustment because the exposure is off as well - underexposed bush and overexposed door frame.', '2003-12-29 14:17:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(525559, 52181, 327, '<td valign="top">Wonderful focus and light. Maybe the crop could of been a bit tighter? Congrats on a nice, clear, clean shot.</td>', 'Wonderful focus and light. Maybe the crop could of been a bit tighter? Congrats on a nice, clear, clean shot.', '2003-12-29 14:17:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(525560, 52467, 12049, '<td valign="top">A great idea, very well executed. But too much text. This would have worked with the main title alone - the other text acts merely to distract from the image and title.</td>', 'A great idea, very well executed. But too much text. This would have worked with the main title alone - the other text acts merely to distract from the image and title.', '2003-12-29 14:18:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(525561, 52532, 327, '<td valign="top">Compliments to you. Text is a bit small, but that I''m sure is due to the size here. Well done!!</td>', 'Compliments to you. Text is a bit small, but that I''m sure is due to the size here. Well done!!', '2003-12-29 14:18:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(525562, 52396, 327, '<td valign="top">Nicely shot. Maybe light the candles? Good colors.</td>', 'Nicely shot. Maybe light the candles? Good colors.', '2003-12-29 14:18:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(525563, 52454, 327, '<td valign="top">Beautiful child, good focus, good title. :)</td>', 'Beautiful child, good focus, good title. :)', '2003-12-29 14:19:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(525564, 52136, 11738, '<td valign="top">I would have preferred seeing your text colour taken from one of the awesome sunset colours rather than white.</td>', 'I would have preferred seeing your text colour taken from one of the awesome sunset colours rather than white.', '2003-12-29 14:19:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(525565, 51995, 327, '<td valign="top">I like it. I like it.</td>', 'I like it. I like it.', '2003-12-29 14:20:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(525566, 52396, 12049, '<td valign="top">The idea is good, but the shot is too busy for me. It mayhave worked better under more intimate lighting conditions - using just the bottle and maybe a candle and a couple of glasses alone. Aside from all that, it doesn''t convey any sense of motivation.</td>', 'The idea is good, but the shot is too busy for me. It mayhave worked better under more intimate lighting conditions - using just the bottle and maybe a candle and a couple of glasses alone. Aside from all that, it doesn''t convey any sense of motivation.', '2003-12-29 14:20:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(525568, 52285, 327, '<td valign="top">lol Funny how cats and even some dogs do that. Okay not funny when you have to pick your tree up!! Cute shot.</td>', 'lol Funny how cats and even some dogs do that. Okay not funny when you have to pick your tree up!! Cute shot.', '2003-12-29 14:21:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(525570, 52281, 12049, '<td valign="top">How is this motivational?</td>', 'How is this motivational?', '2003-12-29 14:21:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(525571, 52364, 327, '<td valign="top">Compliments only. Bravo!!</td>', 'Compliments only. Bravo!!', '2003-12-29 14:21:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(525572, 52521, 11738, '<td valign="top">Awesome crisp focus on the flower in the forefront and good use of DOF.  Crop also very good</td>', 'Awesome crisp focus on the flower in the forefront and good use of DOF.  Crop also very good', '2003-12-29 14:22:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(525573, 52544, 5508, '<td valign="top">the image and title don''t go together. But the images is great. 10</td>', 'the image and title don''t go together. But the images is great. 10', '2003-12-29 14:22:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(525574, 52521, 327, '<td valign="top">My fav. Pansy, my fav. purple and yellow. Wonderful clear, well focused shot. Nice nice nice. Hope you ribbon.</td>', 'My fav. Pansy, my fav. purple and yellow. Wonderful clear, well focused shot. Nice nice nice. Hope you ribbon.', '2003-12-29 14:23:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(525575, 52512, 12049, '<td valign="top">Really nice shot, but my view on this is that the image and title shoudl work alone without supporting text. It is a very nice image though.</td>', 'Really nice shot, but my view on this is that the image and title shoudl work alone without supporting text. It is a very nice image though.', '2003-12-29 14:24:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(525576, 52181, 12049, '<td valign="top">Patience for what? There''s no definitive indication that the seagull is actually waiting for anything at all, so for me this concept isn''t strong enough. Nice image though.</td>', 'Patience for what? There''s no definitive indication that the seagull is actually waiting for anything at all, so for me this concept isn''t strong enough. Nice image though.', '2003-12-29 14:25:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(525577, 52510, 12049, '<td valign="top">I think you entered the wrong challenge ;(</td>', 'I think you entered the wrong challenge ;(', '2003-12-29 14:25:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(525578, 52301, 12049, '<td valign="top">A little too crass to work as a motivational poster ;)</td>', 'A little too crass to work as a motivational poster ;)', '2003-12-29 14:26:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(525580, 51848, 12049, '<td valign="top">Great shot, but this is let down by your choice of font, which is a real shame as this is certainly one of the better entries.</td>', 'Great shot, but this is let down by your choice of font, which is a real shame as this is certainly one of the better entries.', '2003-12-29 14:27:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(525581, 52196, 12049, '<td valign="top">I think that the concept is a little too facile, though the image itself is strong.</td>', 'I think that the concept is a little too facile, though the image itself is strong.', '2003-12-29 14:28:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(525583, 52176, 12049, '<td valign="top">I don''t quite understandyour concept. There''s no notion of fear in tihs shot - the fly appears to be perfectly contented and adapted for this task. Your choice of font hasn''t worked out very well - it''s very fuzzy.</td>', 'I don''t quite understandyour concept. There''s no notion of fear in tihs shot - the fly appears to be perfectly contented and adapted for this task. Your choice of font hasn''t worked out very well - it''s very fuzzy.', '2003-12-29 14:29:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(525584, 52328, 5391, '<td valign="top">Prettiest bristles I''ve personally ever seen.  :)  Great lighting, great mood.  9</td>', 'Prettiest bristles I''ve personally ever seen.  :)  Great lighting, great mood.  9', '2003-12-29 14:30:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(525585, 52444, 12049, '<td valign="top">A very strong marriage of concept and image. I''d actually drop the part in parentheses as it isn''t required - let the viewer figure it out for themselves.</td>', 'A very strong marriage of concept and image. I''d actually drop the part in parentheses as it isn''t required - let the viewer figure it out for themselves.', '2003-12-29 14:30:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(525586, 52364, 12049, '<td valign="top">A good idea and nice photo, but this doesn''t appear to be a very difficult hike so overall the concept isn''t powerful enough. I''d consider making the title larger.</td>', 'A good idea and nice photo, but this doesn''t appear to be a very difficult hike so overall the concept isn''t powerful enough. I''d consider making the title larger.', '2003-12-29 14:32:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(525587, 52490, 11738, '<td valign="top">Very good shot  and love the light.  You captured this at the perfect time of day.  I am impressed.<br/> <br/>The central group of seven geese is perfectly shot.  I would have cloned out that last goose on the right though.  It is either out of focus or has too much motion blur.  Cloning it out and possibly using a closer crop would also have produced an interesting image.  There is also what seems to be a blue dot, roughly 1.5 inches above the right wingtip of that fuzzy goose on the right.  Clone stamp?<br/> <br/>I would have also liked to see the border and the text the same colour to give the image more of a "whole" feeling.</td>', 'Very good shot  and love the light.  You captured this at the perfect time of day.  I am impressed. The central group of seven geese is perfectly shot.  I would have cloned out that last goose on the right though.  It is either out of focus or has too much motion blur.  Cloning it out and possibly using a closer crop would also have produced an interesting image.  There is also what seems to be a blue dot, roughly 1.5 inches above the right wingtip of that fuzzy goose on the right.  Clone stamp? I would have also liked to see the border and the text the same colour to give the image more of a "whole" feeling.', '2003-12-29 14:32:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(525591, 52536, 11738, '<td valign="top">Too bad the "i" of "is" is overlapping the fur trim of her hood. Love the angle of the capture and lighting is quite good also.  DOF is just a teeny bit too shallow.  The hair on her right below the chin looks fuzzy and the edge of the hood on her right looks "off" because of it.</td>', 'Too bad the "i" of "is" is overlapping the fur trim of her hood. Love the angle of the capture and lighting is quite good also.  DOF is just a teeny bit too shallow.  The hair on her right below the chin looks fuzzy and the edge of the hood on her right looks "off" because of it.', '2003-12-29 14:37:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(525592, 52474, 11738, '<td valign="top">Nice sunset, but that patch of clear sky is just soooo overexposed.  Too bad.  Taking this shot from a different angle might have solved this.</td>', 'Nice sunset, but that patch of clear sky is just soooo overexposed.  Too bad.  Taking this shot from a different angle might have solved this.', '2003-12-29 14:39:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(525598, 52378, 11738, '<td valign="top">One of the best of the lot.  Very good light and good clean focus throughout.  I also love your title text with larger S''s and underlining.  However, your secondary title is almost properly aligned but is s tad too close to the right - I measured.</td>', 'One of the best of the lot.  Very good light and good clean focus throughout.  I also love your title text with larger S''s and underlining.  However, your secondary title is almost properly aligned but is s tad too close to the right - I measured.', '2003-12-29 14:46:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(525609, 52478, 6097, '<td valign="top">Love this.  Love the picture and love the quote.  Great Work!  Good luck with the challenge!</td>', 'Love this.  Love the picture and love the quote.  Great Work!  Good luck with the challenge!', '2003-12-29 15:03:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(525610, 52285, 10858, '<td valign="top">Nice idea. :-) Maybe I feel a bit like getting lost in details of the Xmas tree, but it''s humorous. :-)</td>', 'Nice idea. :-) Maybe I feel a bit like getting lost in details of the Xmas tree, but it''s humorous. :-)', '2003-12-29 15:03:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(525612, 52341, 10819, '<td valign="top">I love it! made me smile.</td>', 'I love it! made me smile.', '2003-12-29 15:03:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(525615, 52466, 10858, '<td valign="top">Are these dumbbells? Good idea! :-) Just a bit strange perspective and the text colour clashes with your background.</td>', 'Are these dumbbells? Good idea! :-) Just a bit strange perspective and the text colour clashes with your background.', '2003-12-29 15:04:22.000000', NULL, 1),
