(525900, 51848, 13749, '<td valign="top">wonderful photo.  great compositions and technically sound.  the border + text also looks very professional.  the only thing i would change (which would possibly require just slightly different composition, as a result) is making the standing domino the last in line.  it seems like 4 dominos have fallen on it.. it''s miraculously standing strong.. yet all the rest have fallen over for no reason apparent to me.  and, the dominos at the top of the photo are also still standing.. a composition with this one as the sole domino strong enough to hold its own would convey the message a little better for me.  (it doesn''t bother me as much as it may sound)</td>', 'wonderful photo.  great compositions and technically sound.  the border + text also looks very professional.  the only thing i would change (which would possibly require just slightly different composition, as a result) is making the standing domino the last in line.  it seems like 4 dominos have fallen on it.. it''s miraculously standing strong.. yet all the rest have fallen over for no reason apparent to me.  and, the dominos at the top of the photo are also still standing.. a composition with this one as the sole domino strong enough to hold its own would convey the message a little better for me.  (it doesn''t bother me as much as it may sound)', '2003-12-29 22:56:22.000000', NULL, 1),
