(525970, 52268, 10848, '<td valign="top">Interesting, I told my husband the other day wonder why door remotes aren''t on the market yet, after leaving my car with the remote I have often caught myself puching the buttons on my car remote when wanting to enter the house. ha ha..this is very true , I like the concept and the message that people are getting spoiled to things and are against good hard work I like it 10</td>', 'Interesting, I told my husband the other day wonder why door remotes aren''t on the market yet, after leaving my car with the remote I have often caught myself puching the buttons on my car remote when wanting to enter the house. ha ha..this is very true , I like the concept and the message that people are getting spoiled to things and are against good hard work I like it 10', '2003-12-30 00:59:41.000000', NULL, 1),
