(526013, 52512, 14386, '<td valign="top">IMHO, since this is a poster, the beauty of this shot could''ve been enhanced by a border. Nonetheless, this is truly amazing: colors, compositon, etc.</td>', 'IMHO, since this is a poster, the beauty of this shot could''ve been enhanced by a border. Nonetheless, this is truly amazing: colors, compositon, etc.', '2003-12-30 02:19:21.000000', NULL, 1),
