(526019, 52484, 14386, '<td valign="top">Awesome picture, good composition! I like the lines leading up to the glow of the light. Very symbolic. My favorite in this challenge.</td>', 'Awesome picture, good composition! I like the lines leading up to the glow of the light. Very symbolic. My favorite in this challenge.', '2003-12-30 02:31:03.000000', NULL, 1),
