(526374, 52238, 12733, '<td valign="top">Nice use of slow shutter on the moving water, and a nice contrast between the moving water and the still water.</td>', 'Nice use of slow shutter on the moving water, and a nice contrast between the moving water and the still water.', '2003-12-30 14:28:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(526375, 52560, 12733, '<td valign="top">Fantastic closeup. If I tried to get that close to my cat with a camera, she would probably run for the front door - and out.</td>', 'Fantastic closeup. If I tried to get that close to my cat with a camera, she would probably run for the front door - and out.', '2003-12-30 14:29:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(526376, 52484, 12733, '<td valign="top">Very pretty shot. I don''t really feel the connection with the text and title, though.</td>', 'Very pretty shot. I don''t really feel the connection with the text and title, though.', '2003-12-30 14:31:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(526377, 51901, 12733, '<td valign="top">The text seems to say more to me than the picture.</td>', 'The text seems to say more to me than the picture.', '2003-12-30 14:31:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(526379, 52384, 12733, '<td valign="top">I didn''t know birds could have such expressive faces. Beautiful shot, and it illustrates the text well.</td>', 'I didn''t know birds could have such expressive faces. Beautiful shot, and it illustrates the text well.', '2003-12-30 14:33:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(526380, 52502, 12733, '<td valign="top">Let''s hope the snake sticks to mice!</td>', 'Let''s hope the snake sticks to mice!', '2003-12-30 14:33:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(526381, 52268, 12733, '<td valign="top">Unfortunately, many of them are probably right. The remote is off level by enough to be irritating, but not enough to be a dynamic visual element.</td>', 'Unfortunately, many of them are probably right. The remote is off level by enough to be irritating, but not enough to be a dynamic visual element.', '2003-12-30 14:35:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(526383, 52455, 12733, '<td valign="top">I want to take them both home. Very appealing photo, and I''ll forgive the fact that the phrase is a request and not a motivational.</td>', 'I want to take them both home. Very appealing photo, and I''ll forgive the fact that the phrase is a request and not a motivational.', '2003-12-30 14:37:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(526384, 52285, 12733, '<td valign="top">Very cute shot. I sense a fallen tree in the near future!</td>', 'Very cute shot. I sense a fallen tree in the near future!', '2003-12-30 14:39:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(526386, 52526, 12733, '<td valign="top">So true, and the lighting on the violin is lovely. The angle makes for a dynamic composition. Maybe a little more DOF would have been in order</td>', 'So true, and the lighting on the violin is lovely. The angle makes for a dynamic composition. Maybe a little more DOF would have been in order', '2003-12-30 14:41:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(526387, 52541, 12733, '<td valign="top">Great composition, beautiful colors and a nice sentiment.</td>', 'Great composition, beautiful colors and a nice sentiment.', '2003-12-30 14:42:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(526388, 52396, 12733, '<td valign="top">Lovely colors and lighting, especially on the glasses. But if you''re going to tilt deliberately, do it enough so it is obvious. This gives a slightly off impression that''s almost dizzying.</td>', 'Lovely colors and lighting, especially on the glasses. But if you''re going to tilt deliberately, do it enough so it is obvious. This gives a slightly off impression that''s almost dizzying.', '2003-12-30 14:44:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(526389, 52549, 12733, '<td valign="top">Great portrait. I like the slogan on the photo; the one at the bottom of the frame seems trite by comparison with the title and the upper slogan.</td>', 'Great portrait. I like the slogan on the photo; the one at the bottom of the frame seems trite by comparison with the title and the upper slogan.', '2003-12-30 14:45:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(526390, 52215, 12733, '<td valign="top">The squirrel has the intensity; you got the focus.</td>', 'The squirrel has the intensity; you got the focus.', '2003-12-30 14:45:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(526392, 52521, 12733, '<td valign="top">Beautiful flower and a nice shot. I especially like the lighting on the leaves and the way they contrast with the flower itself.</td>', 'Beautiful flower and a nice shot. I especially like the lighting on the leaves and the way they contrast with the flower itself.', '2003-12-30 14:46:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(526394, 52546, 12733, '<td valign="top">Everyone does seem to be having fun, but the photo is more reminiscent of a posed snapshot at the end of vacation than a competition photo.</td>', 'Everyone does seem to be having fun, but the photo is more reminiscent of a posed snapshot at the end of vacation than a competition photo.', '2003-12-30 14:48:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(526397, 52271, 12733, '<td valign="top">A great idea, but to my mind overdone. I think an interesting composition of light bulbs would say what you want to better than the labels you''ve added.</td>', 'A great idea, but to my mind overdone. I think an interesting composition of light bulbs would say what you want to better than the labels you''ve added.', '2003-12-30 14:50:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(526399, 52472, 12733, '<td valign="top">Interesting idea, and an interesting illustration. Is there a reason that one plant is going around obstacles and the other is managing to grow straight up?</td>', 'Interesting idea, and an interesting illustration. Is there a reason that one plant is going around obstacles and the other is managing to grow straight up?', '2003-12-30 14:52:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(526401, 52530, 12733, '<td valign="top">You''ve certainly made the most of the opportunities in this scene. Great picture.</td>', 'You''ve certainly made the most of the opportunities in this scene. Great picture.', '2003-12-30 14:53:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(526403, 52536, 12733, '<td valign="top">Great choice of pose and clothing to create a mysterious mood. Is her hair reall that color???</td>', 'Great choice of pose and clothing to create a mysterious mood. Is her hair reall that color???', '2003-12-30 14:54:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(526404, 52532, 12733, '<td valign="top">...if you don''t drown first. Great action shot. The churning water is a visual bonus.</td>', '...if you don''t drown first. Great action shot. The churning water is a visual bonus.', '2003-12-30 14:56:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(526405, 52450, 12733, '<td valign="top">That''s a wonderful sentiment, and a nice illustration of it. It has a kind of "snapshot" feel to it, but in this case it works.</td>', 'That''s a wonderful sentiment, and a nice illustration of it. It has a kind of "snapshot" feel to it, but in this case it works.', '2003-12-30 14:57:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(526406, 52378, 12733, '<td valign="top">Are the books an illustration of the ladder to success? Nice blend of colors and composition.</td>', 'Are the books an illustration of the ladder to success? Nice blend of colors and composition.', '2003-12-30 14:59:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(526407, 51995, 12733, '<td valign="top">You got a great look of intensity on the runner''s face. I''m not sure what you meant the arrows to symbolize; they seem to be there for a reason.</td>', 'You got a great look of intensity on the runner''s face. I''m not sure what you meant the arrows to symbolize; they seem to be there for a reason.', '2003-12-30 15:00:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(526408, 52531, 12733, '<td valign="top">A nice composition in colors, and the wool has a beatiful, soft texture. Very pretty shot.</td>', 'A nice composition in colors, and the wool has a beatiful, soft texture. Very pretty shot.', '2003-12-30 15:01:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(526409, 52501, 12733, '<td valign="top">An interesting concept in today''s society. Very nice rendition of the colors and textures, especially the snow.</td>', 'An interesting concept in today''s society. Very nice rendition of the colors and textures, especially the snow.', '2003-12-30 15:04:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(526412, 52527, 12733, '<td valign="top">It''s hard to get the sun to come out as something more than just a big hot spot in a photo. I think in this case it overpowers the rest of the picture and offers too much contrast with the soft leaves and fruit.</td>', 'It''s hard to get the sun to come out as something more than just a big hot spot in a photo. I think in this case it overpowers the rest of the picture and offers too much contrast with the soft leaves and fruit.', '2003-12-30 15:06:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(526413, 52123, 12733, '<td valign="top">Nice night shot. I especailly like the beam flaring out from the green light.</td>', 'Nice night shot. I especailly like the beam flaring out from the green light.', '2003-12-30 15:07:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(526414, 52176, 12733, '<td valign="top">Great closeup. Is the poor fly stuck, or simply getting something (food? moisture?) from the cactus.</td>', 'Great closeup. Is the poor fly stuck, or simply getting something (food? moisture?) from the cactus.', '2003-12-30 15:09:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(526415, 52503, 12733, '<td valign="top">This house doesn''t look all that fearsome, but it''s a nice rendition anyway. The detail on the run-down wood is very good, and the whole picture has a paited quality to it.</td>', 'This house doesn''t look all that fearsome, but it''s a nice rendition anyway. The detail on the run-down wood is very good, and the whole picture has a paited quality to it.', '2003-12-30 15:10:57.000000', NULL, 1),
