(526462, 52341, 3697, '<td valign="top">This is one unique motivational poster. The photo itself is absolutely excellent. Focus, DOF, and the shutter speed you choose... all A++. The framing is also excellent, and I think your choice in colors was definatley a good one. As for your title... it fits well and made me chuckle before I saw the picture. :) nice work.</td>', 'This is one unique motivational poster. The photo itself is absolutely excellent. Focus, DOF, and the shutter speed you choose... all A++. The framing is also excellent, and I think your choice in colors was definatley a good one. As for your title... it fits well and made me chuckle before I saw the picture. :) nice work.', '2003-12-30 16:06:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(526472, 52327, 13152, '<td valign="top">When you enhance or colorise the M&amp;M pay careful attention to the surrounding white M&amp;Ms as they will invariably reflect the green one. This shot looks very retouched, but with a little work could look perfect. Now you''ll probably tell me it is a straight shot and I''ll have to eat my hat (prefereable to eating the M&amp;Ms!)</td>', 'When you enhance or colorise the M&M pay careful attention to the surrounding white M&Ms as they will invariably reflect the green one. This shot looks very retouched, but with a little work could look perfect. Now you''ll probably tell me it is a straight shot and I''ll have to eat my hat (prefereable to eating the M&Ms!)', '2003-12-30 16:37:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(526475, 52328, 13152, '<td valign="top">This is a lovely photograph, but the word ''bristle'' as a verb doesn''t mean the same thing as ''bristle'' as a noun<br/></td>', 'This is a lovely photograph, but the word ''bristle'' as a verb doesn''t mean the same thing as ''bristle'' as a noun', '2003-12-30 16:41:33.000000', NULL, 1),
