(526534, 52123, 6667, '<td valign="top">I see a subliminal Niki commercial here.  Simple but elegant. Nicely done. My only comment is that I don''t even think the added mesaage ubder believe is necessary.  Let the viewer supply it.</td>', 'I see a subliminal Niki commercial here.  Simple but elegant. Nicely done. My only comment is that I don''t even think the added mesaage ubder believe is necessary.  Let the viewer supply it.', '2003-12-30 18:03:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(526539, 52475, 6667, '<td valign="top">Fantastic.  This one hit a personal note.  As a youngster I was building a dog house.  My senior neighbor, who was waching over the fence,  critiqued my hammering skills with, "The wind must be blowing hard today."  I like your thoughts  much, much better!</td>', 'Fantastic.  This one hit a personal note.  As a youngster I was building a dog house.  My senior neighbor, who was waching over the fence,  critiqued my hammering skills with, "The wind must be blowing hard today."  I like your thoughts  much, much better!', '2003-12-30 18:08:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(526562, 52128, 6667, '<td valign="top">Nice bridge!  Having a grown son who  once wrestled I understand this picture and quote.  I just wonder if a non fan gets it.  Nice action shot.  Chest to chest, dig his toes and drive!!!  Love it.  Did he win?!</td>', 'Nice bridge!  Having a grown son who  once wrestled I understand this picture and quote.  I just wonder if a non fan gets it.  Nice action shot.  Chest to chest, dig his toes and drive!!!  Love it.  Did he win?!', '2003-12-30 18:46:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(526565, 52364, 3087, '<td valign="top">Nicely bordered and subject matter really matches the motivational message very well.</td>', 'Nicely bordered and subject matter really matches the motivational message very well.', '2003-12-30 18:47:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(526566, 52238, 3087, '<td valign="top">A lovely motivational message and nice image to go with it. This kind of project is one of the few times when I think a wider border would look better. I''d also opt for a less fussy font. Those are just personal preferences, of course!</td>', 'A lovely motivational message and nice image to go with it. This kind of project is one of the few times when I think a wider border would look better. I''d also opt for a less fussy font. Those are just personal preferences, of course!', '2003-12-30 18:48:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(526567, 52467, 3087, '<td valign="top">A lovely motivational message; a really beautiful thought. The image is also very appealing and striking. My preference would be for image to be larger and the text area/ font sizes smaller.</td>', 'A lovely motivational message; a really beautiful thought. The image is also very appealing and striking. My preference would be for image to be larger and the text area/ font sizes smaller.', '2003-12-30 18:50:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(526568, 52475, 3087, '<td valign="top">This is very www.despair.com! I like it! My only negative point would be that there is a little too much shadow in the top left corner of the image which makes it merge into the border a little too much. But a great image choice and message!</td>', 'This is very www.despair.com! I like it! My only negative point would be that there is a little too much shadow in the top left corner of the image which makes it merge into the border a little too much. But a great image choice and message!', '2003-12-30 18:52:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(526569, 52544, 3087, '<td valign="top">This is beautiful and the image, although quite generic, fits very well with the motivational message. Font, font colour and font size work well. A great poster.</td>', 'This is beautiful and the image, although quite generic, fits very well with the motivational message. Font, font colour and font size work well. A great poster.', '2003-12-30 18:53:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(526570, 52490, 3087, '<td valign="top">Simple, effective, good tie between image and message.</td>', 'Simple, effective, good tie between image and message.', '2003-12-30 18:53:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(526571, 51884, 3087, '<td valign="top">Love it! Very witty!</td>', 'Love it! Very witty!', '2003-12-30 18:54:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(526573, 52541, 3087, '<td valign="top">Another beautiful motivational message and the image works very well indeed. I am not convinced by the decision to split the image into three panels not the drop shadow effect around each panel. Border colour and font choices work well.</td>', 'Another beautiful motivational message and the image works very well indeed. I am not convinced by the decision to split the image into three panels not the drop shadow effect around each panel. Border colour and font choices work well.', '2003-12-30 18:55:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(526574, 51995, 3087, '<td valign="top">Image a little dark for my preferences but fits the message very well indeed and the eye contact makes it striking.</td>', 'Image a little dark for my preferences but fits the message very well indeed and the eye contact makes it striking.', '2003-12-30 18:55:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(526576, 52176, 3087, '<td valign="top">Tell me it''s not Jacko''s dead fly again? (Before the head fell off, naturally).<br/>I like the image and it''s link with the message. Font colour, size and clarity don''t work well for me.</td>', 'Tell me it''s not Jacko''s dead fly again? (Before the head fell off, naturally).I like the image and it''s link with the message. Font colour, size and clarity don''t work well for me.', '2003-12-30 18:56:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(526577, 52530, 3087, '<td valign="top">Nice choice of image though the colours seem pumped up too much. Message works well. I think the thick pink internal borders around text and image are a mistake and it would work best without either.</td>', 'Nice choice of image though the colours seem pumped up too much. Message works well. I think the thick pink internal borders around text and image are a mistake and it would work best without either.', '2003-12-30 18:57:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(526580, 52328, 3087, '<td valign="top">Wonderful balance of light and dark areas. Nice abstract shapes created by your use of light. Not sure that the way the text has been added works as well as other entries but certainly an entry I like quite a lot.</td>', 'Wonderful balance of light and dark areas. Nice abstract shapes created by your use of light. Not sure that the way the text has been added works as well as other entries but certainly an entry I like quite a lot.', '2003-12-30 18:58:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(526581, 52526, 3087, '<td valign="top">Beautiful! Message is wonderful and image fits so well. I like the diagonal of the violin and the way the text has been placed into the negative space of the image. Simple font choice also works well.</td>', 'Beautiful! Message is wonderful and image fits so well. I like the diagonal of the violin and the way the text has been placed into the negative space of the image. Simple font choice also works well.', '2003-12-30 18:59:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(526583, 52542, 3087, '<td valign="top">What a beautiful message and the image works very well with it. I can''t really decide whether the circular crop for the image works for me... I''d have to see it squared off to compare...</td>', 'What a beautiful message and the image works very well with it. I can''t really decide whether the circular crop for the image works for me... I''d have to see it squared off to compare...', '2003-12-30 18:59:53.000000', NULL, 1),
