(526588, 52275, 3087, '<td valign="top">Highly quirky but works very well for me. It has a really modernist feel to it - the limited colour palette of just black, white and red is so classic. The image itself is gritty, offers a weird perspective and makes you look and look again.</td>', 'Highly quirky but works very well for me. It has a really modernist feel to it - the limited colour palette of just black, white and red is so classic. The image itself is gritty, offers a weird perspective and makes you look and look again.', '2003-12-30 19:02:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(526590, 52378, 3087, '<td valign="top">Nicely put together - good colour choices for border and text. Not sure I like the perspective/ angle of view on the pile of books.</td>', 'Nicely put together - good colour choices for border and text. Not sure I like the perspective/ angle of view on the pile of books.', '2003-12-30 19:02:58.000000', NULL, 1),
