(529445, 52310, 14593, '<td valign="top">nice photo....great colors</td>', 'nice photo....great colors', '2004-01-02 10:27:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(529450, 52002, 14593, '<td valign="top">haha....my old IBM didn''t have a cover either!  My son dropped it when he was helping me move, and it wouldn''t work with the cover on....I was happy it just worked at all!  Nice poster and my desk is a mess too!</td>', 'haha....my old IBM didn''t have a cover either!  My son dropped it when he was helping me move, and it wouldn''t work with the cover on....I was happy it just worked at all!  Nice poster and my desk is a mess too!', '2004-01-02 10:29:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(529453, 52176, 14593, '<td valign="top">great photo...nice macro work!</td>', 'great photo...nice macro work!', '2004-01-02 10:30:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(529455, 51876, 14593, '<td valign="top">interesting captured photograph and caption</td>', 'interesting captured photograph and caption', '2004-01-02 10:31:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(529456, 52490, 10402, '<td valign="top">Great photo! Good composition, lighting, and focus. The overall poster layout is also well done. But the birds don''t really seem to be working together; they are just traveling together to the same place.</td>', 'Great photo! Good composition, lighting, and focus. The overall poster layout is also well done. But the birds don''t really seem to be working together; they are just traveling together to the same place.', '2004-01-02 10:32:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(529461, 52444, 14593, '<td valign="top">nice impact poster...</td>', 'nice impact poster...', '2004-01-02 10:36:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(529466, 52196, 10402, '<td valign="top">The texture of the ball shows well here, although there is a halo so it may be oversharpened. Having the club both out of focus and motion blurred works well. The overall poster is nice except that the two fonts don''t really work well together.</td>', 'The texture of the ball shows well here, although there is a halo so it may be oversharpened. Having the club both out of focus and motion blurred works well. The overall poster is nice except that the two fonts don''t really work well together.', '2004-01-02 10:39:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(529476, 52541, 10402, '<td valign="top">Beautiful overall, and interesting (and surprising) when you look closely. The fake triptych format works very well.</td>', 'Beautiful overall, and interesting (and surprising) when you look closely. The fake triptych format works very well.', '2004-01-02 10:51:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(529477, 52271, 7703, '<td valign="top">Broken lightbulb is a good idea but the box</td>', 'Broken lightbulb is a good idea but the box', '2004-01-02 10:52:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(529481, 52478, 14601, '<td valign="top">Terrific capture of this magnificent bird. Depth of field is just right, timing is perfect. I like the way the text is overlayed instead of being in a separate frame. Great entry.</td>', 'Terrific capture of this magnificent bird. Depth of field is just right, timing is perfect. I like the way the text is overlayed instead of being in a separate frame. Great entry.', '2004-01-02 10:54:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(529483, 52532, 14601, '<td valign="top">Beautiful action freeze. I like the thin red border and matching catchword in the poster. Nicely done.</td>', 'Beautiful action freeze. I like the thin red border and matching catchword in the poster. Nicely done.', '2004-01-02 10:56:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(529489, 52431, 14601, '<td valign="top">Beautiful photograph; great color saturation, sharp focus on the bird with nice depth of field to lead into it. I really like the use of the inner line as a border instead of a wide black outside border. My only criticism ( and I don''t know how I would have done it differently ) is that the text gets a little bit lost on the right hand side due to the colors in the image.</td>', 'Beautiful photograph; great color saturation, sharp focus on the bird with nice depth of field to lead into it. I really like the use of the inner line as a border instead of a wide black outside border. My only criticism ( and I don''t know how I would have done it differently ) is that the text gets a little bit lost on the right hand side due to the colors in the image.', '2004-01-02 11:00:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(529491, 52327, 10402, '<td valign="top">Creative! The lighting works surprisingly well; generally double shadows should be avoided, but here it adds to the overall confusion and anonymity of the white candies. The overall poster seems a bit crowded; either remove the white border or put space around it. The aliasing in the font may be part of its individuality, but I find it distracting.</td>', 'Creative! The lighting works surprisingly well; generally double shadows should be avoided, but here it adds to the overall confusion and anonymity of the white candies. The overall poster seems a bit crowded; either remove the white border or put space around it. The aliasing in the font may be part of its individuality, but I find it distracting.', '2004-01-02 11:01:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(529494, 52536, 14601, '<td valign="top">I really like this photo - the angle of the portrait, the colors, the focus, the depth of field - well, everything about it. I can easily see this on a magazine cover. I also like the imbedding of the text into the photo and in  just the right color and intensity. One of the best in this challenge.</td>', 'I really like this photo - the angle of the portrait, the colors, the focus, the depth of field - well, everything about it. I can easily see this on a magazine cover. I also like the imbedding of the text into the photo and in  just the right color and intensity. One of the best in this challenge.', '2004-01-02 11:09:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(529495, 52230, 10402, '<td valign="top">The photo does seem nightmarish, although unnecessarily washed out. It would be a bit zany by itself, but works in the context of the poster. Splitting the word "DREAMS" was a good idea, but white lines on a black background look thicker than the opposite, so top and bottom don''t really match.</td>', 'The photo does seem nightmarish, although unnecessarily washed out. It would be a bit zany by itself, but works in the context of the poster. Splitting the word "DREAMS" was a good idea, but white lines on a black background look thicker than the opposite, so top and bottom don''t really match.', '2004-01-02 11:09:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(529497, 52519, 10402, '<td valign="top">Nice photo. The starlights add beauty and the slant makes it very dynamic. The streaks on the lettering adds character.</td>', 'Nice photo. The starlights add beauty and the slant makes it very dynamic. The streaks on the lettering adds character.', '2004-01-02 11:12:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(529498, 52414, 14601, '<td valign="top">I like the way the flowers come in from the sides; but for me, that leaves too much white in the middle.  Also, for my taste, there are too many different fonts being used ( though that may have been intentional to indicate ''balance'' ).</td>', 'I like the way the flowers come in from the sides; but for me, that leaves too much white in the middle.  Also, for my taste, there are too many different fonts being used ( though that may have been intentional to indicate ''balance'' ).', '2004-01-02 11:13:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(529500, 52271, 14601, '<td valign="top">This is a clever shot, but I really don''t "get it" with this entry - that is, how the title and the image are supposed to match.</td>', 'This is a clever shot, but I really don''t "get it" with this entry - that is, how the title and the image are supposed to match.', '2004-01-02 11:15:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(529502, 52510, 14601, '<td valign="top">Though this is a nicely executed photo of a moving vehicle, I don''t really see how this fits this challenge.</td>', 'Though this is a nicely executed photo of a moving vehicle, I don''t really see how this fits this challenge.', '2004-01-02 11:16:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(529503, 52415, 10402, '<td valign="top">Simple but effective composition. Well chosen elements and good lighting. The font used for "Success" doesn''t work well with the font used for the rest of the text.</td>', 'Simple but effective composition. Well chosen elements and good lighting. The font used for "Success" doesn''t work well with the font used for the rest of the text.', '2004-01-02 11:17:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(529504, 52540, 14601, '<td valign="top">A clever interpretation of the challenge. I especially like the way the leg actually comes OUT by overlaying the border. The photo itself, though, seems a bit flat color-wise.</td>', 'A clever interpretation of the challenge. I especially like the way the leg actually comes OUT by overlaying the border. The photo itself, though, seems a bit flat color-wise.', '2004-01-02 11:18:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(529507, 52466, 14601, '<td valign="top">The photo itself is wonderful but, to my taste, the wrong font and color were selected for the text.</td>', 'The photo itself is wonderful but, to my taste, the wrong font and color were selected for the text.', '2004-01-02 11:19:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(529510, 52281, 14601, '<td valign="top">Nice composition; great color; nice use of edging to separate the instrument from the border.</td>', 'Nice composition; great color; nice use of edging to separate the instrument from the border.', '2004-01-02 11:22:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(529522, 51995, 10402, '<td valign="top">Good pose and expression, and the low key approach works well with the poster''s theme. I don''t know that the runner is in pain yet, but the idea comes across anyway. The orange arrow adds a nice touch of color, but the way it crosses the model''s hand and wrist is rather distracting.</td>', 'Good pose and expression, and the low key approach works well with the poster''s theme. I don''t know that the runner is in pain yet, but the idea comes across anyway. The orange arrow adds a nice touch of color, but the way it crosses the model''s hand and wrist is rather distracting.', '2004-01-02 11:47:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(529559, 52238, 10402, '<td valign="top">Certainly a breathtaking scene. Seems a bit blurry. The colors are probably realistic, but making them a bit warmer would improve the image I think.</td>', 'Certainly a breathtaking scene. Seems a bit blurry. The colors are probably realistic, but making them a bit warmer would improve the image I think.', '2004-01-02 12:09:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(529568, 51901, 10402, '<td valign="top">Effective use of a narrow depth of field. Good composition on the photo, but I wish it was a little bigger in relation to the poster. A thin border around the photo might help as well.</td>', 'Effective use of a narrow depth of field. Good composition on the photo, but I wish it was a little bigger in relation to the poster. A thin border around the photo might help as well.', '2004-01-02 12:18:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(529577, 52271, 10402, '<td valign="top">The photo is set up well and humorous. Good lighting, focus, and exposure. The message it gives me is "Beware of bad ideas!" rather than what the title says.</td>', 'The photo is set up well and humorous. Good lighting, focus, and exposure. The message it gives me is "Beware of bad ideas!" rather than what the title says.', '2004-01-02 12:27:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(529586, 52477, 10402, '<td valign="top">Interesting textures and shapes. The sign is a bit close to the top, but is still the obvious center of interest. I''m not sure what it means, so don''t really understand the allusion to creating a new problem. The sharpness is great except for the sign''s shadow, which has a halo I''m guessing is from oversharpening; since spot editing was allowed for this challenge it would have been nice to avoid that.</td>', 'Interesting textures and shapes. The sign is a bit close to the top, but is still the obvious center of interest. I''m not sure what it means, so don''t really understand the allusion to creating a new problem. The sharpness is great except for the sign''s shadow, which has a halo I''m guessing is from oversharpening; since spot editing was allowed for this challenge it would have been nice to avoid that.', '2004-01-02 12:38:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(529593, 52512, 10402, '<td valign="top">Beautiful colors, nice composition, appropriate quote. The foreground seems a bit dark, especially on the left. The letters are slightly blurry.</td>', 'Beautiful colors, nice composition, appropriate quote. The foreground seems a bit dark, especially on the left. The letters are slightly blurry.', '2004-01-02 12:44:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(529607, 52275, 10402, '<td valign="top">The wide-angle focal length effectively exaggerates the length of the legs. It also distorts the floor tile, but that''s minor. The whiteness of the upper legs is distracting. I don''t care for the red letters; it is too intense. I think orange or gold would go better with the message.</td>', 'The wide-angle focal length effectively exaggerates the length of the legs. It also distorts the floor tile, but that''s minor. The whiteness of the upper legs is distracting. I don''t care for the red letters; it is too intense. I think orange or gold would go better with the message.', '2004-01-02 12:59:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(529610, 52542, 10402, '<td valign="top">Great composition and depth here; it almost seems like the flower is embedded in a crystal ball.</td>', 'Great composition and depth here; it almost seems like the flower is embedded in a crystal ball.', '2004-01-02 13:02:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(529616, 52444, 10402, '<td valign="top">Poignant. A few minor flaws (light rectangle around the words and a bit bright on the top of her shirt and her nose), but very well done. The model has a great pose and the setting is perfect.</td>', 'Poignant. A few minor flaws (light rectangle around the words and a bit bright on the top of her shirt and her nose), but very well done. The model has a great pose and the setting is perfect.', '2004-01-02 13:13:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(529620, 52310, 10402, '<td valign="top">Cropping off the left side to make a vertical format would have better suited the message.</td>', 'Cropping off the left side to make a vertical format would have better suited the message.', '2004-01-02 13:17:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(529627, 52549, 10402, '<td valign="top">Good composition and pose. Tinted monochrome is effective (I don''t care for the color, but I''m color blind, so what do I know!). A catchlight to put a "twinkle" in his eyes would make him look wiser. The focus is soft, which is fine (even preferred for younger people), but older people have great texture in their face and a little sharpening would show it off better.</td>', 'Good composition and pose. Tinted monochrome is effective (I don''t care for the color, but I''m color blind, so what do I know!). A catchlight to put a "twinkle" in his eyes would make him look wiser. The focus is soft, which is fine (even preferred for younger people), but older people have great texture in their face and a little sharpening would show it off better.', '2004-01-02 13:30:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(529726, 52181, 6477, '<td valign="top">Beautiful - the light and the subject to the right make an excellent composition, good luck. The only think I don''t like is the Font you used.<br/></td>', 'Beautiful - the light and the subject to the right make an excellent composition, good luck. The only think I don''t like is the Font you used.', '2004-01-02 15:26:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(529756, 52022, 7703, '<td valign="top">How did you get the big one into this picture? But I don''t like this picture alot. Nothing wow in it ... just plain borring -3</td>', 'How did you get the big one into this picture? But I don''t like this picture alot. Nothing wow in it ... just plain borring -3', '2004-01-02 15:41:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(529816, 52138, 7711, '<td valign="top">i think a little more space to the left and right of the swimmer would have been cool. As would a little more light. But those are small nitpicks. I like the composition and the ''motivational message'' :)</td>', 'i think a little more space to the left and right of the swimmer would have been cool. As would a little more light. But those are small nitpicks. I like the composition and the ''motivational message'' :)', '2004-01-02 16:49:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(529819, 52460, 7711, '<td valign="top">love the colours, and the message. But I think the shot is dwarfed by the border. I understand its a poster challenge, but you want the beautiful bird to be the centre of attention, not the heavy dark border. Perhaps something lighter would have complimented the subject better. Other than that, I like the focus and the composition quite a bit. Its tight with the attention in all the right places.</td>', 'love the colours, and the message. But I think the shot is dwarfed by the border. I understand its a poster challenge, but you want the beautiful bird to be the centre of attention, not the heavy dark border. Perhaps something lighter would have complimented the subject better. Other than that, I like the focus and the composition quite a bit. Its tight with the attention in all the right places.', '2004-01-02 16:52:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(529821, 52364, 7711, '<td valign="top">our guy is just a wee bit too small to be very noticeable, but I like the leading lines and the formidableness of the journey he''s on. Works very well.</td>', 'our guy is just a wee bit too small to be very noticeable, but I like the leading lines and the formidableness of the journey he''s on. Works very well.', '2004-01-02 16:53:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(529837, 52238, 210, '<td valign="top">Love this picture, although I don''t get along too well with the choice of font.  Beautiful.</td>', 'Love this picture, although I don''t get along too well with the choice of font.  Beautiful.', '2004-01-02 17:20:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(529839, 52510, 210, '<td valign="top">It feels too metaphorical w/o a proper title.</td>', 'It feels too metaphorical w/o a proper title.', '2004-01-02 17:20:39.000000', NULL, 1),
