(530019, 52503, 9932, '<td valign="top">This was poster, should have had the text with the image. But I am not going too vote that down. I like the idea. Is this the Mother or Mother In-Laws house? LOL</td>', 'This was poster, should have had the text with the image. But I am not going too vote that down. I like the idea. Is this the Mother or Mother In-Laws house? LOL', '2004-01-02 20:02:40.000000', NULL, 1),
