(530021, 52507, 9932, '<td valign="top">Nice idea. I like what you have. I think the lighting could have been better on the arms and hands.</td>', 'Nice idea. I like what you have. I think the lighting could have been better on the arms and hands.', '2004-01-02 20:05:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(530022, 52366, 9932, '<td valign="top">Why did they have bananas over there?<br/>Nice work I like the overall idea and what you came up with.</td>', 'Why did they have bananas over there?Nice work I like the overall idea and what you came up with.', '2004-01-02 20:06:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(530024, 52123, 9932, '<td valign="top">Very nice idea and effort. I like this very much.</td>', 'Very nice idea and effort. I like this very much.', '2004-01-02 20:07:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(530026, 52475, 12617, '<td valign="top">Excellent, Love the whole idea, caption, lighting, the lot.. -10</td>', 'Excellent, Love the whole idea, caption, lighting, the lot.. -10', '2004-01-02 20:07:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(530028, 52310, 9932, '<td valign="top">Very good. I think a very small white border would have set the image out more. It blends right into the black border. The text seems small and cramped&gt; I Feel you were after the tall effect but I think it could have been better. Nice job!</td>', 'Very good. I think a very small white border would have set the image out more. It blends right into the black border. The text seems small and cramped> I Feel you were after the tall effect but I think it could have been better. Nice job!', '2004-01-02 20:08:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(530029, 52415, 9932, '<td valign="top">Looks more like a late night commercial than a poster?<br/>I don''t like the yellowish background.<br/>Could really be improved upon.<br/>Let us see it if you do another shot at it.</td>', 'Looks more like a late night commercial than a poster?I don''t like the yellowish background.Could really be improved upon.Let us see it if you do another shot at it.', '2004-01-02 20:10:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(530032, 52537, 9932, '<td valign="top">This is motivational?<br/>Seems more like violence or hate?<br/>Will not vote it down for that I vote on the final piece of work and effort.</td>', 'This is motivational?Seems more like violence or hate?Will not vote it down for that I vote on the final piece of work and effort.', '2004-01-02 20:12:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(530036, 52176, 9932, '<td valign="top">Very nice work!<br/>I wish I had this in my room when I was growing up :)<br/>Is that the same bee that someone was keeping in the fridge or freezer? LOL<br/>I would have the the thin boreder to be more white along with the text so it stood out and had more puch.</td>', 'Very nice work!I wish I had this in my room when I was growing up :)Is that the same bee that someone was keeping in the fridge or freezer? LOLI would have the the thin boreder to be more white along with the text so it stood out and had more puch.', '2004-01-02 20:14:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(530039, 52230, 9932, '<td valign="top">Very nice work.<br/>I like the font on Dreams.<br/>I do not like the font at the bottom.<br/>Japanese Proverb should have been smaller and in ( ) I think.<br/>The image seems to be somewhat washed out a little with all the lighting.<br/>Still very nice work and efort.</td>', 'Very nice work.I like the font on Dreams.I do not like the font at the bottom.Japanese Proverb should have been smaller and in ( ) I think.The image seems to be somewhat washed out a little with all the lighting.Still very nice work and efort.', '2004-01-02 20:16:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(530041, 52521, 9932, '<td valign="top">Excellent work.<br/>I wish the border was just a little larger.<br/>Very nice work.<br/>Please show us any of the alternates you may have!</td>', 'Excellent work.I wish the border was just a little larger.Very nice work.Please show us any of the alternates you may have!', '2004-01-02 20:18:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(530043, 51876, 9932, '<td valign="top">Nice catch but not a poster.<br/>I will not vote down for that I vote for effort and final work.</td>', 'Nice catch but not a poster.I will not vote down for that I vote for effort and final work.', '2004-01-02 20:19:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(530046, 52490, 9932, '<td valign="top">Very nice!<br/>I like the contrast you were able to get with the geese.<br/>Did you do any dodging or burning?</td>', 'Very nice!I like the contrast you were able to get with the geese.Did you do any dodging or burning?', '2004-01-02 20:20:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(530052, 52415, 15645, '<td valign="top">It''s a good concept but ''Success'' looks very unreal, unless it''s position is just a coincidence :)</td>', 'It''s a good concept but ''Success'' looks very unreal, unless it''s position is just a coincidence :)', '2004-01-02 20:25:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(530072, 52539, 10402, '<td valign="top">Beautiful photo. I like the lighthouse as a not-quite-silhouette, with the windows discernable. Good composition and poster layout. A sailboat would have fit the text better.</td>', 'Beautiful photo. I like the lighthouse as a not-quite-silhouette, with the windows discernable. Good composition and poster layout. A sailboat would have fit the text better.', '2004-01-02 20:50:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(530073, 52136, 15547, '<td valign="top">I love way the many orange tones are captured.</td>', 'I love way the many orange tones are captured.', '2004-01-02 20:52:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(530074, 52163, 10402, '<td valign="top">Good humorous use of a common object, which is photographed very well. I like the color used here and the various textures of the paper.</td>', 'Good humorous use of a common object, which is photographed very well. I like the color used here and the various textures of the paper.', '2004-01-02 20:53:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(530076, 52285, 15547, '<td valign="top">This is a cute moment!</td>', 'This is a cute moment!', '2004-01-02 20:54:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(530078, 52539, 15547, '<td valign="top">The verse you chose was perfect.</td>', 'The verse you chose was perfect.', '2004-01-02 20:56:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(530080, 52532, 10402, '<td valign="top">Great photo. The obviously precarious situation draws the viewer in, the diagonal kayak adds tension, the wet suit adds a nice splash of color, and the various textures of the water are beautifully captured. The text is a bit small to read easily.</td>', 'Great photo. The obviously precarious situation draws the viewer in, the diagonal kayak adds tension, the wet suit adds a nice splash of color, and the various textures of the water are beautifully captured. The text is a bit small to read easily.', '2004-01-02 20:57:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(530206, 52467, 14601, '<td valign="top">One of few, if not the only entry in just black and white. That works wonderfully for this entry. I wish the snowflake was a little less dense. Nice effect with the font and lettering, especially the larger first/last letters. Great quote. Nice job.</td>', 'One of few, if not the only entry in just black and white. That works wonderfully for this entry. I wish the snowflake was a little less dense. Nice effect with the font and lettering, especially the larger first/last letters. Great quote. Nice job.', '2004-01-02 23:55:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(530207, 52459, 14601, '<td valign="top">Great color, density, etc. Good choice of font, placement over the photo rather than in a separate frame. Might be improved with a border of some kind.</td>', 'Great color, density, etc. Good choice of font, placement over the photo rather than in a separate frame. Might be improved with a border of some kind.', '2004-01-02 23:57:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(530209, 52460, 14601, '<td valign="top">Excellent photograph; great use of color highlighting. Good quote to go with  it. I don''t especially care for the choice of border, although I DO like the small cream border and 3-d look to the photo inside it.</td>', 'Excellent photograph; great use of color highlighting. Good quote to go with  it. I don''t especially care for the choice of border, although I DO like the small cream border and 3-d look to the photo inside it.', '2004-01-02 23:59:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(530213, 52526, 14601, '<td valign="top">Nice composition; great capture of the instrument, color, lighting. I like the placement of the quote and its color and font. I might have also place the bow in the photo to give it a sense that taking some action is a choice.</td>', 'Nice composition; great capture of the instrument, color, lighting. I like the placement of the quote and its color and font. I might have also place the bow in the photo to give it a sense that taking some action is a choice.', '2004-01-03 00:02:37.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(530214, 52521, 14601, '<td valign="top">Very nice composition; perfect depth of field to accent one flower, yet give the sense of the others. I like the overlayed text: font, color, placement. I somehow don''t like the blue border, but can''t say specifically why - I don''t know what I would have chosen for this print.</td>', 'Very nice composition; perfect depth of field to accent one flower, yet give the sense of the others. I like the overlayed text: font, color, placement. I somehow don''t like the blue border, but can''t say specifically why - I don''t know what I would have chosen for this print.', '2004-01-03 00:05:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(530216, 52541, 11078, '<td valign="top">I really like this and think its great work<br/>The boarder over powers it a little but sort of adds to it</td>', 'I really like this and think its great workThe boarder over powers it a little but sort of adds to it', '2004-01-03 00:07:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(530218, 52327, 14601, '<td valign="top">Nice interpretation; great expression of the catchword. I don''t care much for the font that was selected, as it takes focus off the candy, and I think that the overall effect might be improved if the thin white frame was left out - just let the black have control to give even more accent to the white M&amp;M''s.</td>', 'Nice interpretation; great expression of the catchword. I don''t care much for the font that was selected, as it takes focus off the candy, and I think that the overall effect might be improved if the thin white frame was left out - just let the black have control to give even more accent to the white M&M''s.', '2004-01-03 00:10:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(530219, 52535, 14601, '<td valign="top">Terrific photo; great colors; nicely cropped and framed. I think that this particular entry could weather a bolder font just because of it''s theme.</td>', 'Terrific photo; great colors; nicely cropped and framed. I think that this particular entry could weather a bolder font just because of it''s theme.', '2004-01-03 00:12:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(530291, 52503, 15540, '<td valign="top">Motivation doesn''t need words to convey, however it might help here unless there was more emphasis on what is intended on moitivating in this piece.</td>', 'Motivation doesn''t need words to convey, however it might help here unless there was more emphasis on what is intended on moitivating in this piece.', '2004-01-03 02:55:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(530292, 52327, 15540, '<td valign="top">Great contrast and representation; everyone loves M&amp;M''s, so we love individuality.</td>', 'Great contrast and representation; everyone loves M&M''s, so we love individuality.', '2004-01-03 02:56:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(530293, 52532, 15540, '<td valign="top">Fun to overcome.</td>', 'Fun to overcome.', '2004-01-03 02:57:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(530294, 52539, 15540, '<td valign="top">Good lighting, maybe ensure the horizon is a little more level. Just a slight uneveness</td>', 'Good lighting, maybe ensure the horizon is a little more level. Just a slight uneveness', '2004-01-03 02:59:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(530295, 52392, 15540, '<td valign="top">Cliche''ish, but a good shot. Doesn''t quite represent a motivational element.</td>', 'Cliche''ish, but a good shot. Doesn''t quite represent a motivational element.', '2004-01-03 03:00:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(530296, 52475, 15540, '<td valign="top">Great abstract, it''s a negative motivation so it needs a degree of positive motivation; another statement for this can be "Practice" -- and progressively do better from back to front.</td>', 'Great abstract, it''s a negative motivation so it needs a degree of positive motivation; another statement for this can be "Practice" -- and progressively do better from back to front.', '2004-01-03 03:02:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(530297, 52341, 15540, '<td valign="top">Hard to tell what this is; I know it''s a dog! Right!? Well, those that aren''t familiar with animals will be less likely to identify and therefore visualize.</td>', 'Hard to tell what this is; I know it''s a dog! Right!? Well, those that aren''t familiar with animals will be less likely to identify and therefore visualize.', '2004-01-03 03:04:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(530299, 52181, 15540, '<td valign="top">Phrase may need some work for the picture; motivation is based on inducement or intiative, what here comes of patience?</td>', 'Phrase may need some work for the picture; motivation is based on inducement or intiative, what here comes of patience?', '2004-01-03 03:07:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(530300, 52537, 15540, '<td valign="top">Need to see the blade, lighting could be more subtle, Ninja''s work in dark shadows, stealthy, change that. The word Unite is too big, Shorten its height across the same width area. Good idea though.</td>', 'Need to see the blade, lighting could be more subtle, Ninja''s work in dark shadows, stealthy, change that. The word Unite is too big, Shorten its height across the same width area. Good idea though.', '2004-01-03 03:09:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(530301, 51919, 15540, '<td valign="top">Not a very good dead end. I want to see the alley way or something that has no way out.</td>', 'Not a very good dead end. I want to see the alley way or something that has no way out.', '2004-01-03 03:10:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(530302, 52530, 15540, '<td valign="top">Color is unrealistic For motivation it must be realistic, yet beyond our reach.</td>', 'Color is unrealistic For motivation it must be realistic, yet beyond our reach.', '2004-01-03 03:12:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(530304, 52557, 15540, '<td valign="top">You may want to center the wreath, it makes a slight difference that there is not symmetry. But clear and picture that represents the motivation.</td>', 'You may want to center the wreath, it makes a slight difference that there is not symmetry. But clear and picture that represents the motivation.', '2004-01-03 03:15:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(530305, 52540, 15540, '<td valign="top">A little on the scare side of motivation, maybe leave out the scream and let it be a little subtler frustration and working on it.</td>', 'A little on the scare side of motivation, maybe leave out the scream and let it be a little subtler frustration and working on it.', '2004-01-03 03:16:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(530306, 52268, 15540, '<td valign="top">Being a little picky, if that remote is going to be my motivation, I want something much more significant that that, give me a bigger remote, or one with exceptional buttons. Not too many or too elaborate, but no a simple, run of the mill.</td>', 'Being a little picky, if that remote is going to be my motivation, I want something much more significant that that, give me a bigger remote, or one with exceptional buttons. Not too many or too elaborate, but no a simple, run of the mill.', '2004-01-03 03:17:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(530307, 52502, 15540, '<td valign="top">A little morbid for motivation.</td>', 'A little morbid for motivation.', '2004-01-03 03:18:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(530308, 52521, 15540, '<td valign="top">Great.</td>', 'Great.', '2004-01-03 03:18:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(530309, 52460, 15540, '<td valign="top">Great photo. It might be more impressive going up the stairs, that gives a natural psychological meaning of going up and making it, not going down.</td>', 'Great photo. It might be more impressive going up the stairs, that gives a natural psychological meaning of going up and making it, not going down.', '2004-01-03 03:20:02.000000', NULL, 1),
