(530317, 52466, 15540, '<td valign="top">Rotate the image so the bells are right side-up and change the carpet to a nice hard floor. Good representation of weights, give more thought to the inspirational thought. Maybe like Persistance : weight makes shoulders broaden and build.</td>', 'Rotate the image so the bells are right side-up and change the carpet to a nice hard floor. Good representation of weights, give more thought to the inspirational thought. Maybe like Persistance : weight makes shoulders broaden and build.', '2004-01-03 03:29:03.000000', NULL, 1),
