(530319, 52136, 15540, '<td valign="top">What is the foreground article? Great shot, but many will be bewildered by the unknown "thing". I am at least.</td>', 'What is the foreground article? Great shot, but many will be bewildered by the unknown "thing". I am at least.', '2004-01-03 03:30:40.000000', NULL, 1),
