(530334, 52560, 15540, '<td valign="top">Great white contrast, if one item on this can had excentuaion, it would just startle and emphasize; like the eyes or something.</td>', 'Great white contrast, if one item on this can had excentuaion, it would just startle and emphasize; like the eyes or something.', '2004-01-03 03:45:06.000000', NULL, 1),
