(530443, 52502, 7889, '<td valign="top">This is not motivating and I wonder why you bothered to enter this for this particular challenge. Technically the angle does not work, the background slants too much and it is out of focus so I give you a 1.</td>', 'This is not motivating and I wonder why you bothered to enter this for this particular challenge. Technically the angle does not work, the background slants too much and it is out of focus so I give you a 1.', '2004-01-03 09:11:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(530447, 52510, 7889, '<td valign="top">Well maybe you were mixed up with this challenge and the action shot?!! You get a 1 from me. The title is not motivational and nor is this photo.</td>', 'Well maybe you were mixed up with this challenge and the action shot?!! You get a 1 from me. The title is not motivational and nor is this photo.', '2004-01-03 09:13:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(530479, 52474, 11895, '<td valign="top">sky looks a bit oversaturated but otherwise a very nice picture, I especially like that you got some texture in the foreground</td>', 'sky looks a bit oversaturated but otherwise a very nice picture, I especially like that you got some texture in the foreground', '2004-01-03 10:30:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(530482, 52532, 11895, '<td valign="top">very nice picture, border and title are not as good</td>', 'very nice picture, border and title are not as good', '2004-01-03 10:32:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(530484, 52361, 11895, '<td valign="top">looks to me like too much processing has taken the sharpness out of what may have been a very nice picture, maybe cropping the bottom would help</td>', 'looks to me like too much processing has taken the sharpness out of what may have been a very nice picture, maybe cropping the bottom would help', '2004-01-03 10:36:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(530489, 52499, 10402, '<td valign="top">Wonderful photo. Soft and dreamy. A few technical problems (glare on the taller girl''s jacket and lots of artifacts from low quality JPEG compression). I don''t like the composition of the overall poster; cramming words into the bottom margin just doesn''t work. The top and side margins are great, but the bottom needs about twice as much, and the quote needs to be right justified with the right edge of the photo. The letters in the quote are garbled, but I think this is due to the same compression artifacts that plague the photo. DPChallenge allows files up to 150K, so a higher quality compression setting can be used to avoid these.</td>', 'Wonderful photo. Soft and dreamy. A few technical problems (glare on the taller girl''s jacket and lots of artifacts from low quality JPEG compression). I don''t like the composition of the overall poster; cramming words into the bottom margin just doesn''t work. The top and side margins are great, but the bottom needs about twice as much, and the quote needs to be right justified with the right edge of the photo. The letters in the quote are garbled, but I think this is due to the same compression artifacts that plague the photo. DPChallenge allows files up to 150K, so a higher quality compression setting can be used to avoid these.', '2004-01-03 10:46:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(530490, 52536, 11895, '<td valign="top">the unnatural looking red hair color detracts from an otherwise very good entry</td>', 'the unnatural looking red hair color detracts from an otherwise very good entry', '2004-01-03 10:47:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(530495, 52215, 11895, '<td valign="top">more of the image being in focus would have gone better with this text but on the whole a nice effort</td>', 'more of the image being in focus would have gone better with this text but on the whole a nice effort', '2004-01-03 10:51:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(530498, 52366, 11895, '<td valign="top">too dark, looks too processed especially arund the monkey and the ropes</td>', 'too dark, looks too processed especially arund the monkey and the ropes', '2004-01-03 10:56:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(530500, 52123, 10402, '<td valign="top">Hmmm... This light is green, so traffic along Victory Lane is stopped. ;-)<br/> <br/>Sorry, couldn''t resist. This photo conveys just the message the text suggests. I like the way the green light shines and the fact that the darkness in the photo isn''t quite black (like the poster background is). Good composition; putting the light and sign so close to the edge of the photo is daring, but it works here because of the vast negative space.</td>', 'Hmmm... This light is green, so traffic along Victory Lane is stopped. ;-) Sorry, couldn''t resist. This photo conveys just the message the text suggests. I like the way the green light shines and the fact that the darkness in the photo isn''t quite black (like the poster background is). Good composition; putting the light and sign so close to the edge of the photo is daring, but it works here because of the vast negative space.', '2004-01-03 10:59:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(530501, 52534, 11895, '<td valign="top">very good idea, I like the colors a lot but the processing has left the skin too smooth and unnatural looking, especially near the center</td>', 'very good idea, I like the colors a lot but the processing has left the skin too smooth and unnatural looking, especially near the center', '2004-01-03 10:59:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(530511, 52196, 11895, '<td valign="top">the ball and tee look oversharpened but that is the only flaw I can see</td>', 'the ball and tee look oversharpened but that is the only flaw I can see', '2004-01-03 11:15:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(530513, 52181, 10402, '<td valign="top">Good bird shot. The bright subject stands out nicely against the dark background. Good focus and DOF. Needs a little more space at the top. The poster layout is OK, but the font choice is poor; the breaks in the letters are too wide for white-on-black use. The connection between the photo and the text is tenuous; birds aren''t generally known for their extreme patience.</td>', 'Good bird shot. The bright subject stands out nicely against the dark background. Good focus and DOF. Needs a little more space at the top. The poster layout is OK, but the font choice is poor; the breaks in the letters are too wide for white-on-black use. The connection between the photo and the text is tenuous; birds aren''t generally known for their extreme patience.', '2004-01-03 11:16:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(530515, 52181, 11895, '<td valign="top">a little on the dark side and too bad the tail feathers aren''t all there</td>', 'a little on the dark side and too bad the tail feathers aren''t all there', '2004-01-03 11:18:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(530518, 52521, 11895, '<td valign="top">colors need to be brighter, they look a bit dull to me, otherwise a very nice entry</td>', 'colors need to be brighter, they look a bit dull to me, otherwise a very nice entry', '2004-01-03 11:21:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(530523, 52341, 11895, '<td valign="top">very good idea, but way too much border and not enough picture; would have liked the picture a little brighter</td>', 'very good idea, but way too much border and not enough picture; would have liked the picture a little brighter', '2004-01-03 11:25:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(530524, 52414, 10402, '<td valign="top">I like how you''ve used words as part of the image, rather than relegating them to the margin like most of the posters.</td>', 'I like how you''ve used words as part of the image, rather than relegating them to the margin like most of the posters.', '2004-01-03 11:25:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(530526, 52405, 11895, '<td valign="top">a beautiful picture but looks over-processed as you have lost definition in the waves and the foreground is not sharp, I miss texture in the rocks, maybe more depth of field and sharper focus would improve it''s appeal</td>', 'a beautiful picture but looks over-processed as you have lost definition in the waves and the foreground is not sharp, I miss texture in the rocks, maybe more depth of field and sharper focus would improve it''s appeal', '2004-01-03 11:31:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(530528, 52128, 10402, '<td valign="top">Great shot, captured at just the right moment. Could use some sharpening. Matches the text perfectly.</td>', 'Great shot, captured at just the right moment. Could use some sharpening. Matches the text perfectly.', '2004-01-03 11:33:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(530533, 52465, 10402, '<td valign="top">Great pose! The text helps balance the composition; without them the bird would be too far to the right. (Even with them, a bit more space on the right would be helpful, but not as critical.) Some sharpening might be helpful, and I think a black border would work better than a white one; it would help bring out the text and the black feathers better.</td>', 'Great pose! The text helps balance the composition; without them the bird would be too far to the right. (Even with them, a bit more space on the right would be helpful, but not as critical.) Some sharpening might be helpful, and I think a black border would work better than a white one; it would help bring out the text and the black feathers better.', '2004-01-03 11:44:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(530534, 52544, 10402, '<td valign="top">Great detail and color. Gives a nice peaceful feeling that matches the quotation well.</td>', 'Great detail and color. Gives a nice peaceful feeling that matches the quotation well.', '2004-01-03 11:46:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(530546, 52444, 14601, '<td valign="top">Powerful message; simple text; Subtle tones add to the impact. Nicely done.</td>', 'Powerful message; simple text; Subtle tones add to the impact. Nicely done.', '2004-01-03 12:11:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(530548, 52531, 14601, '<td valign="top">Excellent entry for this challenge. Love the colors, especially agains the black background. I also like the mat-style border - almost as if the print were already framed. I''d like to see what kind of difference it would make if the lower text line were split into two lines with a . . . connector.</td>', 'Excellent entry for this challenge. Love the colors, especially agains the black background. I also like the mat-style border - almost as if the print were already framed. I''d like to see what kind of difference it would make if the lower text line were split into two lines with a . . . connector.', '2004-01-03 12:14:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(530549, 51919, 14601, '<td valign="top">Excellent choice of monotone to emphasise the message. Cropping is just right. I think that I''d try the text in a smaller font to direct the eye to the image, then let it naturally move to the message below.</td>', 'Excellent choice of monotone to emphasise the message. Cropping is just right. I think that I''d try the text in a smaller font to direct the eye to the image, then let it naturally move to the message below.', '2004-01-03 12:19:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(530553, 52366, 14601, '<td valign="top">I like this compostion overall - framing, border, text, etc.,  but the photo doesn''t support the message . For monkys, hanging in there is the fun part - getting to the other side is really not all that important.</td>', 'I like this compostion overall - framing, border, text, etc.,  but the photo doesn''t support the message . For monkys, hanging in there is the fun part - getting to the other side is really not all that important.', '2004-01-03 12:23:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(530557, 52176, 14601, '<td valign="top">I like the photo, framing, and message. I don''t care for the fonts chosen for the text - the text appears to be somewhat blurry.</td>', 'I like the photo, framing, and message. I don''t care for the fonts chosen for the text - the text appears to be somewhat blurry.', '2004-01-03 12:28:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(530560, 52512, 14601, '<td valign="top">Very striking photograph. I love the color; like the placement of the text, etc. This photo would benefit for this challenge with a nice border, and, since this challenge permits some spot editing, I think darkening the forground ( land portion )might improve the look.</td>', 'Very striking photograph. I love the color; like the placement of the text, etc. This photo would benefit for this challenge with a nice border, and, since this challenge permits some spot editing, I think darkening the forground ( land portion )might improve the look.', '2004-01-03 12:32:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(530603, 52341, 7889, '<td valign="top">This is a very good photo but does not hit me as an motivational poster, shake it off? It might be because i do not understand what message you are trying to get across. 6</td>', 'This is a very good photo but does not hit me as an motivational poster, shake it off? It might be because i do not understand what message you are trying to get across. 6', '2004-01-03 14:03:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(530606, 52454, 7889, '<td valign="top">Does nothing to motivate me except to give it a vote of 1 - to me it does not meet the requirements of this particular challenge. <br/></td>', 'Does nothing to motivate me except to give it a vote of 1 - to me it does not meet the requirements of this particular challenge. ', '2004-01-03 14:05:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(530611, 52549, 14601, '<td valign="top">Great portrait work. I love the message, too. I think that having the embedded text in black might improve the entry.</td>', 'Great portrait work. I love the message, too. I think that having the embedded text in black might improve the entry.', '2004-01-03 14:11:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(530613, 52378, 14601, '<td valign="top">Ah. Wish it were true. Very nice work on the book stack - colors are perfect. Love the matching frame and text - just the right font, placement, framing, etc. The underline was just the right touch.</td>', 'Ah. Wish it were true. Very nice work on the book stack - colors are perfect. Love the matching frame and text - just the right font, placement, framing, etc. The underline was just the right touch.', '2004-01-03 14:14:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(530614, 52181, 14601, '<td valign="top">Love the photo, composition, etc. I don''t care for the font selection, though I do like the message.</td>', 'Love the photo, composition, etc. I don''t care for the font selection, though I do like the message.', '2004-01-03 14:16:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(530684, 52230, 14601, '<td valign="top">I like the black on white/white on black hollow text at the top. Overall, the image is too bright for my taste, and the focus on the monster too soft.</td>', 'I like the black on white/white on black hollow text at the top. Overall, the image is too bright for my taste, and the focus on the monster too soft.', '2004-01-03 14:54:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(530693, 52546, 14601, '<td valign="top">Nice candid. A bit busy, though. Better framing and text placement would improve this entry.</td>', 'Nice candid. A bit busy, though. Better framing and text placement would improve this entry.', '2004-01-03 14:57:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(530734, 52136, 14614, '<td valign="top">Excellent photo and title - a quote would have made this even better.</td>', 'Excellent photo and title - a quote would have made this even better.', '2004-01-03 15:53:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(530740, 52479, 14614, '<td valign="top">The quote works well with the bare tree. You''ve got a powerful image and quote - to make it more so  I''d like to see the photo cropped a bit - or shrunk down so the words could use more of the space.  I''d suggest profile vs. landscape orientation and the author''s name smaller or in italics.</td>', 'The quote works well with the bare tree. You''ve got a powerful image and quote - to make it more so  I''d like to see the photo cropped a bit - or shrunk down so the words could use more of the space.  I''d suggest profile vs. landscape orientation and the author''s name smaller or in italics.', '2004-01-03 15:55:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(530742, 52499, 14614, '<td valign="top">I like the feel of the photograph - the quote and title compliment the poster.  The font size for the quote is too small and perhaps a bit too fancy.</td>', 'I like the feel of the photograph - the quote and title compliment the poster.  The font size for the quote is too small and perhaps a bit too fancy.', '2004-01-03 15:58:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(530744, 52181, 14614, '<td valign="top">This one made me smile.  You''ve captured the perfect moment and expression on the bird''s face.  Only suggestion - different/plainer font - I thought it detracted from the overall statement.</td>', 'This one made me smile.  You''ve captured the perfect moment and expression on the bird''s face.  Only suggestion - different/plainer font - I thought it detracted from the overall statement.', '2004-01-03 15:58:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(530745, 52561, 14614, '<td valign="top">Technically, very good.  THe photo needs more impact or drama to really fit the "motivational" theme.</td>', 'Technically, very good.  THe photo needs more impact or drama to really fit the "motivational" theme.', '2004-01-03 16:00:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(530747, 52472, 14614, '<td valign="top">Personnaly, I don''t like the box around the title/quote. It chops off part of the photo but then there''s a vine hanging on below the words pulling my eye down there.  Not sure but I think I would have cropped out the tree.   Otherwise, very interesting photo that nails the quote. Simple and impactful</td>', 'Personnaly, I don''t like the box around the title/quote. It chops off part of the photo but then there''s a vine hanging on below the words pulling my eye down there.  Not sure but I think I would have cropped out the tree.   Otherwise, very interesting photo that nails the quote. Simple and impactful', '2004-01-03 16:02:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(530748, 52431, 14614, '<td valign="top">Like the boarder, quote, and title.  Only criticism is the words on the far right blend into the lighter refection and draw my eye away from the subject.</td>', 'Like the boarder, quote, and title.  Only criticism is the words on the far right blend into the lighter refection and draw my eye away from the subject.', '2004-01-03 16:03:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(530749, 52544, 14614, '<td valign="top">One of the top shots!  Excellent quote, nicely spaced and placed.  Photo isn''t as tied to the title as it is to the quote - that tension had me read the quote again and reflect - just what you want a motivational poster to do. 10</td>', 'One of the top shots!  Excellent quote, nicely spaced and placed.  Photo isn''t as tied to the title as it is to the quote - that tension had me read the quote again and reflect - just what you want a motivational poster to do. 10', '2004-01-03 16:04:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(530751, 52478, 14614, '<td valign="top">Crisp image and powerful quote.  Not sure the tie to an eagle. 9</td>', 'Crisp image and powerful quote.  Not sure the tie to an eagle. 9', '2004-01-03 16:06:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(530753, 52415, 14614, '<td valign="top">Composition is a bit flat so not as motivating.  I think a bit less cream backgound might help</td>', 'Composition is a bit flat so not as motivating.  I think a bit less cream backgound might help', '2004-01-03 16:07:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(530755, 52405, 14614, '<td valign="top">Excellent quote - need to atribute the source.  Powerful image that supports the title.  The typesetting detracts from the poster as it stands "apart" from it and is not a part of it. 7</td>', 'Excellent quote - need to atribute the source.  Powerful image that supports the title.  The typesetting detracts from the poster as it stands "apart" from it and is not a part of it. 7', '2004-01-03 16:09:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(530757, 52530, 14614, '<td valign="top">Very powerful photo.  The pink boarders detract from the two key elements (photo and quote).</td>', 'Very powerful photo.  The pink boarders detract from the two key elements (photo and quote).', '2004-01-03 16:10:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(530758, 52507, 14614, '<td valign="top">Excellent photo and title.  Minor critique on the font selected - it doesn''t add as much as it could to the overall poster. 8</td>', 'Excellent photo and title.  Minor critique on the font selected - it doesn''t add as much as it could to the overall poster. 8', '2004-01-03 16:12:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(530759, 52521, 14614, '<td valign="top">Like the quote and its position and color.  The background yellows are a bit distracting, pulling my attention away from the main subject and quote 8</td>', 'Like the quote and its position and color.  The background yellows are a bit distracting, pulling my attention away from the main subject and quote 8', '2004-01-03 16:14:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(530761, 52334, 14614, '<td valign="top">One of my favorite quotes (would like to see the attribution)  Nice composition and black/white/red color selection. Light on the back of man''s head draws too much attention -- makes him look "cut out and pasted on"  Like the triple boarder.</td>', 'One of my favorite quotes (would like to see the attribution)  Nice composition and black/white/red color selection. Light on the back of man''s head draws too much attention -- makes him look "cut out and pasted on"  Like the triple boarder.', '2004-01-03 16:17:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(530763, 52503, 14614, '<td valign="top">Excellent title/quote but not sure it goes with the photo (no sense of fear)</td>', 'Excellent title/quote but not sure it goes with the photo (no sense of fear)', '2004-01-03 16:19:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(530766, 52176, 14614, '<td valign="top">Not sure I can connect with the fly(?) as a symbol of success but the shot is interesting.  The title and quote (author?) need to be a stronger element in the poster.  The color/size/ font could be better.</td>', 'Not sure I can connect with the fly(?) as a symbol of success but the shot is interesting.  The title and quote (author?) need to be a stronger element in the poster.  The color/size/ font could be better.', '2004-01-03 16:21:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(530767, 52550, 14614, '<td valign="top">Would like to have seen the title on the shot. 7</td>', 'Would like to have seen the title on the shot. 7', '2004-01-03 16:22:45.000000', NULL, 1),
