(530789, 52539, 14614, '<td valign="top">One of the top ones!  Like the metaphor of the lighthouse, it compliments the quote and the title.  Minor suggestion - the font/size of the font for the quote could be bigger/kept to two lines/type set differently.  Something about it is a smidge off. 9</td>', 'One of the top ones!  Like the metaphor of the lighthouse, it compliments the quote and the title.  Minor suggestion - the font/size of the font for the quote could be bigger/kept to two lines/type set differently.  Something about it is a smidge off. 9', '2004-01-03 16:48:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(530790, 52532, 14614, '<td valign="top">So many things to like about this one... landscape layout, use of red to frame photo and highlight title and the quote itself ties it all together.  I think the quote could be set larger (maybe one long line)  and I''d like to see some part of the person''s head. 9</td>', 'So many things to like about this one... landscape layout, use of red to frame photo and highlight title and the quote itself ties it all together.  I think the quote could be set larger (maybe one long line)  and I''d like to see some part of the person''s head. 9', '2004-01-03 16:49:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(530791, 52542, 14614, '<td valign="top">Great quote - text compliments the image (color, spacing, position) Macro shot is great with the snow crystals, I am a bit distracted by the blurry items in the background - they need to be either more blurry or less bright.  Nice Job 9</td>', 'Great quote - text compliments the image (color, spacing, position) Macro shot is great with the snow crystals, I am a bit distracted by the blurry items in the background - they need to be either more blurry or less bright.  Nice Job 9', '2004-01-03 16:49:22.000000', NULL, 1),
