(531440, 52396, 2553, '<td valign="top">Feels more like an advertisement, than a motivational poster, however, the shot is very nicely done.  The only thing I would change would have been to use the Perspective in Photoshop to "reorient" the perspective of the shot.  Nice warm lighting in the background works well with this shot.</td>', 'Feels more like an advertisement, than a motivational poster, however, the shot is very nicely done.  The only thing I would change would have been to use the Perspective in Photoshop to "reorient" the perspective of the shot.  Nice warm lighting in the background works well with this shot.', '2004-01-04 15:01:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(531442, 52431, 9932, '<td valign="top">Very nice shot. Not crazy about the font color though.</td>', 'Very nice shot. Not crazy about the font color though.', '2004-01-04 15:03:21.000000', NULL, 1),
