(531461, 52334, 2553, '<td valign="top">Fabulous photo, choice of borders and colors works for me; don''t particularly care for the typography at the top - I''m not sure if it''s the font choice, or the bullets that separate the lettering, but I''m not crazy about that part.  The look on that child''s face is adorable!</td>', 'Fabulous photo, choice of borders and colors works for me; don''t particularly care for the typography at the top - I''m not sure if it''s the font choice, or the bullets that separate the lettering, but I''m not crazy about that part.  The look on that child''s face is adorable!', '2004-01-04 15:32:47.000000', NULL, 1),
