(531734, 52542, 12268, '<td valign="top">Kids inspire everyday but none such as you on this day. Congrats on your first ribbon! As my earlier comment echoed, there is SO MUCH to love about this!</td>', 'Kids inspire everyday but none such as you on this day. Congrats on your first ribbon! As my earlier comment echoed, there is SO MUCH to love about this!', '2004-01-05 00:05:09.000000', NULL, 0),
