(531740, 52540, 1280, '<td valign="top">I want to sincerely thank all of you who took the time to comment.  I knew the focus was soft, but it was the best my weary old camera could do.  A new one is enroute!!! :-) Anyway, it was the concept I was confident of, and not really the technical aspects.  Apparantly some of you agreed.  Thanks for recognizing the thought that went into this.</td>', 'I want to sincerely thank all of you who took the time to comment.  I knew the focus was soft, but it was the best my weary old camera could do.  A new one is enroute!!! :-) Anyway, it was the concept I was confident of, and not really the technical aspects.  Apparantly some of you agreed.  Thanks for recognizing the thought that went into this.', '2004-01-05 00:07:48.000000', NULL, 0),
(531741, 51848, 6870, '<td valign="top">This is just marvelous work, Ben!</td>', 'This is just marvelous work, Ben!', '2004-01-05 00:08:25.000000', NULL, 0),
