(532213, 52539, 11738, '<td valign="top">Thanks for the vote folks.<br/> <br/>Well, I must say I''m pretty happy with results.  I attained two of the goals I had set out for myself on DPC in 2004:<br/> <br/>1) I finally got a top-10 finish<br/>2) I got one of my submissions to crack the magical 7.0 barrier.<br/> <br/>The "cherry on top" would have been a ribbon.<br/> <br/>Thanks for all the comments.  I plan on re-doing this poster for a print available through DPCPrints.<br/> <br/><b>EDIT:</b>  And oh yeah, I''ll be straightening out that crooked horizon too.  Always check that from now on.  Live and learn<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2004-01-05 11:13:31.</i></td>', 'Thanks for the vote folks. Well, I must say I''m pretty happy with results.  I attained two of the goals I had set out for myself on DPC in 2004: 1) I finally got a top-10 finish2) I got one of my submissions to crack the magical 7.0 barrier. The "cherry on top" would have been a ribbon. Thanks for all the comments.  I plan on re-doing this poster for a print available through DPCPrints. EDIT:  And oh yeah, I''ll be straightening out that crooked horizon too.  Always check that from now on.  Live and learn', '2004-01-05 10:29:33.000000', '2004-01-05 11:13:31.000000', 0),
(532339, 52378, 714, '<td valign="top">I''ll see what I can do Mary.  :-)<br/> <br/>Thank you all for your wonderful comments.  I have learned from this shot and hopefully plan to do more in the future like it.  <br/> <br/>Soni</td>', 'I''ll see what I can do Mary.  :-) Thank you all for your wonderful comments.  I have learned from this shot and hopefully plan to do more in the future like it.   Soni', '2004-01-05 12:09:21.000000', NULL, 0),
