(536085, 52541, 6870, '<td valign="top">Very lovely work, Nella. Such clarity and crisp focus where it needs to be. I like the tryptich idea, too. Congratulations on your ribbon!</td>', 'Very lovely work, Nella. Such clarity and crisp focus where it needs to be. I like the tryptich idea, too. Congratulations on your ribbon!', '2004-01-08 09:47:31.000000', NULL, 0),
